<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Rom</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Pol Jisas kogonmo ere wan moglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Na Pol, Krais Jisas niglmo kogonmo yagl moglka. God na ye dedugwa yobamo ta moratnedi na agle didre, ye kamo wakai yoba di tenatnedi na kere i pere edugo, moglka.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Ka wakai i, ka kaima unabiwe di ye kamo kep yobamo di togo, ye okna ibo ye kamo du paugwa i mina bogl atne edigwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ka wakai i, ye Wam nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais pre paugwa. Jisas Krais yoba moglmere i we, King Devit gawamo moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Te, ye murubuglomo du paugwa i we, ye gogl adigl u kor ogwa igine, ye God Wam kaima mogl, yobuglomo podo paugwa ere i nogugl edugwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />No ye aposelma yoko kaima moraiglmedi noruko, no yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo Jisas pre medraiglkwa swara sika sio di tomgo, Jisas kagie wanugwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Te, yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglmara i, Jisas Krais ene Rom yoba ama agle dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Ene dumo Rom kipaigwa i, na pepa i bogl teiga. God ene dem muduo tedre, ye yobama du moraiglmedi agle dugo, meglkwa. Na prika i, Neno Kade God ya Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais, yoko kaima ene ere wakai ere tedre, deno muduno wida di tenabredi prika.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol dumo Rom kanagledi prukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Na ka komono kana dinaglka i, yegl paugwa, Jisas Krais konbo yauro norumara na Godna di wakai yei teiga. I siragl pre yoba uglo koglo koglo ene Jisas pre mediglmedi ka podo di meglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Na ege ege ene pre kamage erika God yene pre kan erukwa. God i na dena muduna bogl kogonmo ersre, ye Wam kamo wakai yoba di teiga. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Na ege ege kamage erika i, konbo ta yenan, God wakai ta pran, na ene meglmara unagledi konbo ta yauro narabedi kamage erika. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />I siragl pre ene ka kaima kanagledi prika. U ene kandre, kiano mina ake ple di tebo, yobuglo inaiglmedi prika. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Na prika i, na pre mediglka i, kandre, yobuglo ibi, te ene pre mediglkwa i na ama kandre, yobuglo ibo, ikne ikne deno muduno si gigle dinamnedi prika.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Agrama abarama wagle, ene pre kan eraiglmedi prika i, na ege tau mere ene meglmara unagledi erika ba taragl ta ege ege si kegl dugwa. Na unagledi prika i, Jentail tau meglmara kogon erimere yegl, ene meglmara ama kogon eribo, mogo wakai korabedi prika. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />I siragl pre yoba Grik ka digwa mo di kankrikwa i mo, nomano podo paugwa mo du paigwa i, Jisas kamo di tenaglka dinau mere yegl pai moglmedi prika. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Pai moglkwa pre ene dumo Rom meglkwa i, Jisas kamo wakai ene ama di tenagledi nomana aduglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas kamo wakai i mina God yoba ere yugwa<figure style="fig" alt="Rome" file="hk00242c.tif" size="span" loc="1.1-15" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="1.15">Taun kade Rom</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Na Krais kamo wakai yoba di tenaglka i, agai ta goglkraglka. I siragl pre ka i God yobuglomo podo atne paugo, yoba iramna pre medraiglkwa i, mudu ere inabuka. Ka i komono kana Juda yoba pidre, okuo Jentail yoba enabuka. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ka wakai i mina God du moglmere mere moramga i, ama i nogugl edugwa. Pre medramga keme. Kuno yegl mere God kamo mina okna ibo bogl, Yoba ta pre mediglbi, God ye yoba du meglmedi kanan, yoba i kor aimadi moraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Habakuk 2.4</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba mudu God mokono teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ba yoba ta God mokono tedre, mabuno kide beglkwa i, God heven ibo mogl, mudu dem kubro tomere i nogugl edugwa. Yoba i, God kamo kaima yogwa i pre dinamnedi mabuno kide beglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Te, God pre kan eraiglkwa God yene i nogugl ede togwa pre nogugl pai kodugwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />God dumo makan ere yogwa igne ede u erme pra, God taragl kane kane ere yogwa i yoba kandre, ye God kaima moglkwa ya yobuglo podo aimadi kamin paugwa i, kan pogl si kodigwa. God siragl mere moglkwa i, yoba gumuglno mina ta kankrikwa ba ye taragl ere yogwa i kandre, kan pogl sigwa pre ye ere mogl, No God ta pre kan erekune dinaiglkwa i, ka kaima kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Yoba i God pre kan erikwa ba ye God moglmedi kagie kade tekre, ye ama di wakai yei tekrikwa. Ta tekriko, ye nomano u kide ogo, ye nomano mina pre pogl sikre, du mere yegl erikwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ye nomano podo pame digwa ba ye du erikwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Ersre, God aimadi kamun kor morabuka abuglagemo podo sugwa i, mokono tedre, yoba ege sugunagle meglkwa i kwiano bekidre, kua ya agl bugla ya gur toki kane kane kwiano bekidre, God agaimo taragl i tedre, kagie kade te wan meglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Yoba yegl erikwa pre God ye tadaglme siragl mere deno muduno mina ta eramnedi prikwa i, eraiglmedi kanige erukwa. Kanige eruko, ye mabuno deglbi yogwa i ersre, yene ikne ikne ogono nagino mina agai mabuno erikwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ersre, God siragl mere kaima moglkwa i prakiure, ka kibi keme pre mediglkwa. God taragl kane kane ere yogwa i, ye kagie kade teigwa ba God taragl mudu Nem yagl moglkwa i kagie kade tekrikwa. Ba God aimadi kamun kagie kade i pai morabuka. Kaima.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Yoba mabuno yegl beglkwa pre God ye kide kodidre, agai mabuno eraiglmedi kanige erukwa. Abu ama yagl bogl bogl swara panaiglkwa i kide kodo, mabuno paikrumere mere abu yene abu ake ikne ede igwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Erimere kuno yegl, yagl ama abu bogl panaiglkwa mabuno pamere kide kodidre, yagl bogl panamnedi nomano adiglsre, agai mabuno erikwa. Eriko, ye topo kide ta inaiglmere ogono nagino mina igwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Yoba i God siragl mere moglkwa i toruo sinabedi prikwa pre God ye moko tedre, nomano kide pamere sika sidre, mabuno paikrumere eraiglmedi kanige erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Kanige eruko, yoba i mabuno kide kane kane ya, mabuno tom ya, bubuno geglkwa mabuno ya, kuda ikne mabuno ye nomano mina kau sidre, kigl nonga mabuno ya, yoba si geglkwa mabuno ya, ka kibi mabuno ya, yoba ere kide ere tenamga mabuno ama nomano kau sidre, kenaglno mabuno ya, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />mokono ka mabuno, God kide kanigwa mabuno ama nomano mina kau sugwa. Te, yoba kagno ere kide erikwa mabuno ya, yene kagno ake mitna edigwa mabuno kau sidre, mogl mitna edigwa mabuno ya, mabuno kide kor tau ama eramnedi nomano mina pre epigl ere, neno mano kano ama sedigwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Te, ye nomano u kide ogo, ka dimara adigl moglkre, yoba deno muduno tekre, mitno goglkrikwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />God lomo du paugwa i, yoba mabuno yegl eribi, goraiglme dugwa ye prikwa ba ye prisre, ere pai meglkwa. Ere pai moglsre, yoba pere mabuno kide yegl beglkwa i, ye gun yei tedre, ama wakai erimedi kanigwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Yoba God lomo si biglke digwa i, God ka tage tenabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ba ene ogon mogo buglo sidre, Yoba i, yoba kide meglkwa ba na yoba wakai mole dinga i, kuno paikrukwa. Ye mabuno kide erimere ene ama etnga pre ene ka tage teo dinga igne, ene ama ka tage naro dinga mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Mabuno kide yegl beglkwa i, God mabuno du ersre, ka tage tomedi prumga. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Prumga ba ene pitnga God yoba yegl ka tage tenabuka kuno erukwa ba na mabuno yegl boglbo, ye ka tage narekrabedi pitno? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Mo God ene mitn gogl, nomane kor inatnedi kanana sugl moglsre, mabuno wakai kaima ere te moglkwa i, kide pitno? God ene mabuno wakai te moglkwa i, nomanen yake tenatnga pre erumedi prekitnga paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ba ene nomane kor inakiursre, nomanen si gigle dinga i, ka tage u podo enabedi ere motnga. God kubrabuka egemo udre, ye mabuno du mina ka tage tenabuka ege ede nogugl unan, inatnga. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />God yoba swara swarade mabunono erimere kuno yegl ere te ikne edenabuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 62.12</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Edidre, yoba aimadi kamun kor moragledi prisre, God na wakai etniwe didre, ka wakai di narabedi prisre, mabuno wakai ege ege konbo dokugwa i, God ye aimadi kamun kor morabuka i, tenabuka. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Tenabuka ba yoba ta ege ege yene we di prisre, ka kaima sika sikre, mabuno kide sika sigwa i, God dem podo kubrisre, ka tage tenabuka. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Yoba mudu mabuno kide beglkwa i, giugl podo prisre, ibun podo inaiglkwa. Juda yoba komono ibi, Jentail yoba mokomugl inaiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ba yoba mudu mabuno wakai beglkwa i, God ye wakai erimedi ka wakai di tedre, dem muduo wida di padigl tenabuka. Komono kana Juda yoba tedre, mokomugl Jentail yoba tenabuka. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />I siragl pre God yoba mudu mabuno swara keme ere togwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Ana Jentail yoba God lomo pre kan erekre, tadaglme erikwa i, God ka tage tenabuka. Lo pre kan erekrikwa i pre teke erekraiglkwa. Te Juda yoba God lomo pre kan ersre, tadaglme erikwa i, God lo idre, ka tage tenabuka. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />I siragl pre God lomo pre kan ersre keme God gumuglo mina du ta moglkraiglkwa ba ege ege duglo beglbi, du moraiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Jentail yoba God lomo prekrikwa ba ege sike ta lo pamere konbo sidre, duglo beglkwa. Duglo beglkwa igne, ye yene mabuno wakai sika sinamga pamedi i nogugl edigwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />I nogugl edidre, God lomo ama deno muduno mina bogl atne edumedi i nogugl edigo, deno muduno pogl nogwa i, ama i nogugl edugwa. Wakai etne dumo mo kide etne dumo mo God lomo atne pamedi i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />I nogugl edugo, ege swara ta unan, God Jisas dedenan, yoba nomane teke atne paugwa i, kot ere tenabuka. Na ka wakai dimere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba ama God lomo si biglke digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ba ene Juda yoba meglkwa i we, No Juda yoba kra. God lo no norumiwa. God bogl si dakagl muniwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />God nomanemo prumniwa. Te God lomo mina skul dumga pre No mabuno wakai pre mitna edumne digwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Te, yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, konbauna obuno dumnedi prisre, mim meglkwa i, abuglageno munedi prisre, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />du paigwa ya gak kebra neno yagle munedi prikwa. I siragl pre God lomo mabuno kaima ya ka kaima pre dugwa i, pre pogl si kodumnedi prikwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Ene yoba ka beke tenga i, enene ka beke teno? Yoba kunogl nekraiglmedi ka beke tenga i, ene kunogl neno? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Mo abu kunogl nekrio dinga i, ene abu kunogl neno? Taragl kibi kane kane kamage ere teigwa i, kide kaima pitnga ba ene ede lotu yuguno pidre, taraglno kunogl neno? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />God lo narumedi kagin ake mitna edinga i, God kagie kide inabedi lomo si biglki dino? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />God kamo bage ta okna yegl beglkwa, Yoba yugobuno pere meda meglkwa i, ene Juda yoba mabunono kandre, God kagie kide teimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 52.5, Esekiel 36.22</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Ene Juda yoba nagino puduo nagie boglsre, yoba wakai munedi prikwa i, ene ege ege lo duglo beglbi, praiwa. Ba lo duglo boglkribi, yoba nagino puduo nagie boglkrikwa i bogl kuno meglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Te, nagino puduo nagie boglkrikwa i lo mudu dumere sika sibi, God ye Juda yoba mere meglmedi kanabuka. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Te, ene Juda yoba lo ake moglsre, nagino beglkwa ba nagino boglkrikwa yoba lo sika sibi, ene lo si biglki digwa yoba meglme dinaiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ka kaima yoba ta Juda yagl abu suo wano morabuka ba Juda kaima ta moglkrabuka. Te nagino beglkwa mabuno kaima i, nagino meda beglkwa pre ta manugwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Juda yoba kaima i, dem muduo suna ime God duglo boran, ye Juda kaima morabuka. Te nagino puduo kaima beglkwa i, lo dumere nagino meda boglkrikwa ba Mudu Murubuglo kiano mina eruko, kiano mina nagino beglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Yoba i, yoba ye debino sikraiglkwa ba God debino sinabuka.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">God ye ka dumara adigl moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Yegl mere panan, Juda yoba nagino beglkwa i, ye taragl wakai ta imo? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Taragl wakai mere igwa. Ta igwa podo paugwa i, God Juda yoba ye kamo sugl moraiglmedi togwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ba Israel yoba tau pre mediglkre, adigl gigle dikrikwa i we? Ye pre medigl adigl gigle dikrikwa i pre God ye kamo plau dinabedi eran, kuno erekrabo? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ka kaima ta manabuka. Yoba mudu ka kibi di, kano mina adigl morglkraiglkwa ba God ege ege ka kaima keme dinabuka. Yegl paugwa pre okna ibo yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">God yo, ene ka siragl mere dinga i, yoba ene ka kaima keme dinedi praiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Te, yoba ta ene kot ere tenagledi eran, ene ege ege win sinatnga keme pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 51.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:4">di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ba yoba tau ka yegl dinaiglkwa, No mabuno kide erumga i, God swara yagl du moglmedi i nogugl edumniwe dinaiglkwa. Ka yegl dibi, God no sugwa i, aglau erume dinamno? <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Kaima ta dikramga. God no sugwa aglau erume dumun, yoba mudu kot ere tenabuka kuno erekrabuka paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Paugwa ba yoba i aglke kor didre, No ka kibi dumga i, God ka kaima keme dugwa pamedi kandre, kagie kade tenaiglkwa pame dinaiglkwa. Didre, No tadaglmeno kot ere norukwa kuno erekrume dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ba ka yegl dinamnedi pribi, Pra God kagie kade inabedi tadaglme mere kide erio do. Ba yoba nomane kide yegl paugwa i, God ye ka tage tenabuka kuno kaima erukwa. Te yoba tau na ama ka kide yegl dume di, kenaglna sigwa ba dikrika.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba mudu tadaglme yoba meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Ana nono siragl we dinamne? No Juda yoba wakai mungo, Jentail kide meglme dinamno? Ta manugwa! Na ene obuno di te kodiga. Juda ya Grik yoba akie tadaglme mina atne kane pamga. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Mabuno yegl paugwa pre God kamo yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">Yoba du ta moglkrikwa. Swara kaima ta manugwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Te, yoba ta nomane mina pre pogl sidre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">God doko kanagledi erukwa swara kaima ta moglkrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Yoba mudu God mokono tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Yoba mudu u kide pi kodigwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Yoba ta mabuno wakai boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">swara kaima ta moglkrukwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 14.1-3, Giglage 53.1-3</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Yoba drano i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">yoba geglko, kubuno erumere yegl, kubuno kide erukwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Ye drabino ka kibi dinaiglmedi beke teigwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 5.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Toki kide yoba sumere mere yegl, ye yoba kenaglno kede sigwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 140.3</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Yoba drano mina yoba ta ere kide ere tedre, di kide keme yei teigwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 10.7</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Yoba ere mogl, yoba ta si goramnedi tabre wan u ikne ikne pidre, te,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />ye aglo mere eigwa i, yoba ere kide ere tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:16">yubun tedre, yegl keme erikwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Te, ye yoba pere bogl deno muduno swara yei kankrikwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 59.7-8</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Yoba God kuduglmo gogl kankrimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 36.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:18">di, God kamo yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Yegl pre nono pre pogl sumga i, yoba God lomo atne meglkwa i, lo ye pre paugo, ye pre ama dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 3:19">Yegl pre yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i God lomo prisre, God gumuglo mina tadaglme yoba munedi pre, drano si kegl di, ka ta di ikne edekraiglkwa pre paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />I siragl pre yoba ta God lomo mudu duglo boglsre, God gumuglo mina du morabuka, yoba swara ta moglkrukwa. God lomo i, yoba prisre, tadaglme eunedi pre kan eraiglkwa pre paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta Jisas pre medran keme God gumuglo mina yoba du morabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Du moglkramga ba God gumuglo mina nono erme yoba du moraiglmedi konbauna kor ta i nogugl ede norukwa. Konbauna kor i, God lomo duglo boramga i ta manugwa ba Moses ya ka kep yoba ka bogl atne edigwa i, konbauna i pre digwa i we, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />yoba Jisas Krais pre mediglbi, God ye du moglmere moraiglmedi erabuka. Yoba mudu pre medraiglkwa i, ye yegl ere tenabuka. Konbono pere pere ta yeikrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />I siragl pre yoba mudu pra pra tadaglme ersre, God yagl du kaima mogl, abuglagemo podo kide sugo, moglmara enamga i, yage sumga. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ba God yene wakai prumere ere wakai ere norsre, Krais Jisas nono topo si ikne edumara i mina God yoko kaima no yoba du meglme dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Didre, yoba ira pre medraiglkwa i, ye kumapno Jisas moglmara edugo, ye bormaimo suru ede, tawano moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 3:25">I mina God yagl du moledi i nogugl edugwa. I siragl pre ye okna ibo yoba tadaglmeno kanige erukwa i, aglau erekrukwa. Ye Jisas okuo dedinagledi prisre, tadaglmeno si bi di togwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Te erme God ye yoba du meglmedi kanugwa i, ama kuno erukwa. I siragl pre ye yoba kumapno yoko kide kodokrukwa. Ye mabuno du eragledi yoba Jisas pre mediglkwa i, ye kumapno Jisas tedre, ye yoba du meglme dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Yegl paugwa pre taragl swara ta erumnara i mina kagino kade imno? Kaima ta ikrumga. Nono mabuno wakai bun, konbo ta yomo? Ta yeikrukwa. Nono Jisas pre medramga keme konbo yogwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Yegl paugwa pre nono di kodinamga, God lomo duglo boglkramga ba pre medun keme God gumuglo mina du moramga.<verse eid="ROM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />God Juda yoba Godno keme moglmo mo ye Jentail yoba ama Godno moglme? Ye ama Jentail yoba Godno moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />I siragl pre God swara moglko, nagino beglkwa mo boglkrikwa i, pre mediglmara swara i mina ye yoba du meglmedi kanugwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ana nono Jisas pre medunga pre God lomo kogonmo ta paikrume dumno? Ta manugwa. God lomo kogonmo wakai pai moglmedi i nogugl edumga.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">God ye Abraham pre meduglmara yagl du moglmedi kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ana erme Abraham, no Juda yoba munga i, kowano awano moglkwa i pre dinaglka. God Abraham yagl du moglmedi kanugwa i, Abraham mabuno wakai ta boglkwa pre ye yagl du moglmedi kanumo mo konbauna pere ta yomo mo i, erme nono pramga. <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />God Abraham mabuno wakai ta boglko, kandre, yagl du moglmedi kankrukwa. Ye mabuno wakai ta boglko, kandre, yagl du moglmedi kanuma, Abraham ye yene kagie ake mitna edenabuka i, kuno eruko. Ba Abraham pre meduglkwa swara i God kandre, Abraham yagl du moglmedi kanugwa pre Abraham ye yene kagie ake mitna edenabuka i, kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />God kamo okna ibo beglkwa i yegl dugwa, Abraham ye God kamo pre meduglkwa pre God ye Abraham pre meduglkwa i kandre, yagl du moglmedi kanumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 15.6</char></note> di, God kamo yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Ana yoba ta mige kogon ersre, topo yugwa i, ye topo yoko ta ikrukwa. Kogon erumara i mina yugwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ba God mabunomo pere paugwa. God ye yoba kogon erikwa mo mabuno wakai ta beglkwa kandre, topo mere yegl tedre, yoba du meglmedi kankrukwa. Yoba kide ta mabuno wakai boglkrukwa ta morabuka ba ye God kamo pre meduglmara swara i mina God kandre, ye yoba du moglmedi kanabuka.<verse eid="ROM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Ana okna ibo King Devit mem swara i pre ka swara ta ama boglkwa. Ye ka boglkwa i, yoba ta gun podo yenabuka pre boglkwa. Yoba i mabuno wakai ta boglkrukwa ba God ye konbauna ta mina yoba i du moglmedi kanugwa pre ka yegl boglkwa,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />Yoba ta God lomo si biglke dinabuka ba God ye erukwa i gugl ede tenan, gun podo yenabuka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Ye tadaglme erukwa i si bi di togwa i pre gun podo yenabuka.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Yagl Kade ye yoba i tadaglmemo i aimadi pre moglkrabuka i pre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">ye gun podo yenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 32.1-2</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 4:8">di, Devit okna ibo yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Ana King Devit ka ta okna boglkwa i, yoba ta tadaglme erabuka i, God gugl ede tenan, gun podo yenabuka pre dugwa. Yegl dugwa i, Juda yoba, ye nagino puduo nagie beglkwa yoba i keme gun podo yenaiglkwa pre dumo mo yoba yugobuno pere, nagino puduo nagie boglkrikwa i ama gun podo yenaiglkwa pre dume? Nono pre pogl sinamga. God kamo Abraham pre dugo, nono prumga i, Abraham pre meduglmara i pre God ye yagl du moglmedi kanume dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ana God ye Abraham pre meduglkwa kandre, yagl du moglmedi kanugwa i, Abraham nagie puduo nagie boglkwa igne mo boglkrukwa igne kanugwa pre dume? Ye dugwa i, okna Abraham nagie puduo nagie boglkrukwa igne, God ye Abraham pre meduglkwa i kandre, yoba du moglmedi kanugwa pre dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ana God komono kana Abraham yagl du moglmedi kandre, okuo ye nagie puduo nagie borabedi di togwa i, muno gane mere yegl ere padrabuka pre dugwa. God ye komono kana Abraham pre meduglkwa i kandre, yagl du moglmedi kan kodugwa i, i nogugl edenabuka pre muno gane ere paduglo dugwa. Yegl pre yoba yugobuno pere pere meda mogl, nagino puduo nagie boglkrikwa ba ye God kamo pre mediglkwa pre God ye du meglmedi kanugwa i, Abraham ye yoba mudu i, kowano awano mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Te, Abraham ye Juda yoba nagino puduo nagie bunga yoba munga i, ama kowano awano moglkwa. Ba Abraham ye Juda yoba mudu kowano awano kaima ta moglkrukwa. Juda yoba tau ye nagino puduo nagie beglkwa ba ye Abraham pre meduglmere yegl ta pre mediglkrikwa i, Abraham ye kowano awano kaima ta moglkrukwa ba Abraham nagie puduo boglkrukwa igne pre meduglmere yegl Juda yoba tau ye pre mediglkwa i keme ye kowano awano kaima moglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Okna ibo, God ye Abraham ka kaima ta di te padigl, Ene ya ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa i, dumo makan uglo kogl koglo yogwa i, inaiglmiwe dugwa. Ye Abraham yegl di togwa i, Abraham ye God lomo duglo boglkwa pre dikrukwa ba Abraham ye kamo pre meduglko, God ye yagl du moglmedi kandre, ye ka kaima yegl di te paduglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ana God ye yoba ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, yoba ye lomo duglo boglsre, ta inaiglkwa panan, yoba ta God kamo pre mediglkwa i mina ta ikraiglkwa mere paugwa pre ye pre mediglkwa i, ye ake ple di tekrukwa mere yegl panabuka. Ba mabuno yegl ta paikrukwa. Yoba swara ta God lomo duglo boglsre, God ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, ta ikrabuka. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />I siragl pre yoba God lomo duglo boramnedi erikwa i ye mudu lomo si biglke digwa. Si biglke digwa pre God ye dem kubro tenabuka keme paugwa. Lo ta paugwa igne, yoba si biglke digwa keme paugwa. Lo ta paikrukwa igne i swara yoba si biglke dikrikwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ana God ka kaima ta di te paduglkwa i, yoba ye lomo duglo boglsre keme inaiglkwa panan, God prukwa, yoba swara ta ikrabuka. Yegl pre ye ere mogl, yoba ta ye pre medraiglkwa i, inaiglme dugwa. Ye yegl dugwa i, ye yoba yoko kaima ere wakai ere tenan, Abraham gawama mudu ye ka kaima ta di te paduglkwa i, inaiglkwa pre dugwa. Juda yoba ye God lomo pre kan erimara i pre inaiglkwa pre dikrukwa ba yoba mudu Abraham pre meduglmere yegl ta pre medraiglkwa i, inaiglkwa pre dugwa. I siragl pre nono pre medunga yoba i, Juda yoba mo yugobuno pere ta munga ba Abraham nono mudu kowano awano mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Mabuno yegl pre God kamo mina okna ibo yegl beglkwa, God ye Abraham di te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:17">Na ene gawanma mere kide moglsre, yugobuno pere pere moraiglmedi ere edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 17.5</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 4:17">di, yegl dumiwe di, yegl beglkwa. Yugobuno pere pere we dugwa i, nono pre medunga yoba mudu pre dugwa. Yegl pre God gumuglo mina Abraham nono mudu kowano awano moglkwa. Te, Abraham ye God pre meduglme dumga i, ye God wakai kaima ta moglkwa pre meduglkwa pre dumga. God we dumga i, ye yoba geglkwa ere i kor edidre, taragl ta paikrukwa igne i, ye ka dumara mina taragl mudu plau dugwa. God yegl mere moglkwa pre dumga.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ana God okna ibo ka ta Abraham di te, Ene gawanma kugl kuri mere yegl, mere kide moraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 15.5</char></note> dugwa. God ka yegl dugwa ba igne i, Abraham kidagl yei kodugwa pre taragl yegl ye moglmara plau dinabuka kuno erekrukwa. Yegl paikrukwa ba Abraham ere mogl, ka i kaima na moglmara plau dinabiwedi prisre, pre meduglkwa pre ye gawama kaima u mere kide pi moglsre, yugobuno pere pere God moraiglme dumere kuno yegl meglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ana God ka ta Abraham di te paduglkwa igne i Abraham bugla yugu 100 mere yegl nogwa pre ye pre kan erukwa i, ye erme gak kurabuka mere yegl moglkrukwa. Ye prukwa i, Na ogona nagna mina gogl kodiga mere yegl moliwe di prukwa. Te, ye ebie Sara ama temne paugwa pre gak ta kuglkrumiwedi prukwa. Abraham yegl prukwa ba ye God kamo pre meduglkwa i, gigle dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />God ka kaima ta Abraham di te paduglkwa i, Abraham kina suo gu dikre, kaima plau dinabedi prukwa. Yegl prukwa pre ye pre meduglkwa i, pi gigle dugo, ye God kaima erabukra we di, kagie kade togwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Abraham prukwa i, God ka kaima ta di nare paduglkwa i, ye yobuglomo podo paugwa pre ye ka kaima erabuka keme pamiwe di, yegl pre meduglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Yegl pre meduglkwa pre God ere mogl, ye yagl du moglmedi kanugwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Ana God ye Abraham pre meduglkwa i kandre, yagl du moglmedi kanumiwe di, God kamo yegl dugwa i, Abraham swara pre dikrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Ka i nono pre ama akie dugwa. Nono Yaglno Kade Jisas goglko, God ye ere i kor edugwa. Nono God i pre medunga pre nono ama du meglmedi kanabuka i kuno erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />God ye Jisas gorabedi dedugwa i, nono tadaglmeno pre gorabedi dedugwa. Te, nono topono te kodugwa pre God gumuglo mina nono yoba du moraiglmedi ye Jisas ere i kor edugwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">God bogl deno muduno swara yomga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ana nono Jisas pre medunara swara i mina God nono yoba du meglmedi kan kodugwa. Yegl pre nono okna God kudamo ikne munga i, erme moglkrumga. Nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina nono erme God bogl deno muduno swara yomga. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Te, nono erme munga i, God nono ere kide erekre, yoko kaima ere wakai ere norumara i mina atne kra mogl kodumga. Mogl kodumga i, nono Jisas pre medungo, ye konbauna yauro norumara i mina nono ede suna pidre, munga. Moglsre te, nono okuo God abuglagemo podo sumara ye bogl akie wakai kaima moramga i, kaima yegl moramnedi prisre, gun podo yomga pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ana nono okuo God bogl akie moramga i pre gun yedre, te nono erme makandigle mogl, yubun yumga i ama gun podo yenamga. I siragl pre nono pre kan erumga i, nono yubun yumnara i, nono si gigledi norukwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Yubun kane kane umara i, nono si gigledi noruko,yobuglo idre, kaglno mina adigl munga. Te, nono kaglno mina adigl munga igne, nono okuo God bogl wakai kaima moramnedi prumga ikra ama u gigle dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Te, nono okuo God bogl wakai kaima moramnedi pre gi dumga i, u yoko ta enan, kide pramga mere yegl ta manugwa. Nono ka kaima ye bogl akie aimadi kamun wakai moramga i, nogugl paugwa. Nogugl paugwa i siragl pre God ye dem muduo siragl mere norukwa i, i nogugl ede kodugwa. Ye Mudu Murubuglo noruko, Mudu Murubuglo nono deno muduno mina kogon ersre, God dem muduo podo kide norukwa i, i nogugl ede norukwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ana prio. Nono okna meda kaima mogl, ede God moglmara enamga i, konbaunano ta yeikrukwa igne, Krais u nono God mokono tomga yoba munga i, ere inagledi goglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Nono yoba mabunono siragl mere paugwa i, kamga. Yoba ta yoba du morabuka ba yoba pere ta ye ake ple di tenagledi gorabo mo goglkrabe? Ta goglkrabuka. Ana yoba swara ta wakai kaima moran, yoba pere ta ye ake ple di tenagledi gorabo mo goglkrabo mo i na ta prikrika. Yoba suom ta yegl eraiglkwa ba mere yegl ta erekraiglmedi prika. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Nono yoba mabunono yegl ta paikrukwa ba God mabunomo pai pere edugwa. God ye Krais dedugo, u nono pre goglkwa i, nono yoba wakai mungo, u goglkrukwa. Tadaglme yoba mogl pai mungo, ye u nono pre goglkwa. God ye Krais nono ere inabedi dedumara i mina ye nono tadaglme yoba dem muduo podo norukwa i, i nogugl edugo, kamga.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ana nono erme pre pogl sinamga. Jisas ye bormaimo suru edidre, goglmara i, God ye nono yoba du meglmedi kan kodugwa. Yegl pre okuo God kor dem kubro noro, ka tage norabo? Ta manabuka. Jisas kogon erumara i mina nono ere i kodugwa pre nono okuo ka tage norabuka i ta kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ene prio! Nono okna God kudamo ikne munga ba ye Wam goglmara i mina aglke kor nono yu yene moglmara magigl edugo, nono ye bogl deno muduno swara yei, akie munga. Jisas goglmara i mina God nono yu yene moglmara magigl edugwa pre Jisas erme adigl u kor pidre, kor moglmara i mina nono aimadi kamun wakai kaima moramga keme paugwa. God okuo nono ka tage norabuka i ta kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Yegl paugo, te nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina nono erme God bogl deno mudu swara yei, akie munga i pre nono erme God gun yei tenamga.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adam erumara i mina geglkwa mabuno yumga ba Jisas erumara i mina kor meglkwa i, yumga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ana okna ibo yagl Adam swara ye tadaglme erumara i mina tadaglme ede suna udre, yoba mudu uglo kogl koglo meglkwa i, bi di kodugwa. Te, tadaglme ede suna umara i, geglkwa mabuno akie ugwa. Adam erumara i, tadaglme ede suna ugo, yoba mudu uglo kogl koglo meglkwa i ama tadaglme erikwa pre ye mudu geglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Oknayene ibo, God ye lomo yoba tekrukwa igne i yoba lo prikre, si biglke digwa ba tadaglme erikwa. God ye lomo yoba tekrukwa pre yoba i ye lomo si biglke dimedi bogl atne edekrukwa ba yoba i tadaglme erikwa pre <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />ye mudu ama geglkwa. Adam komono kana tadaglme erukwa i, ye God lo ta togo, si biglke dugwa. Ana Adam moglkwa igne ede u Moses moglsre, God lomo idre, yoba togwa igne suna i, God lomo tekrukwa pre yoba si biglke dikrikwa ba ye ama tadaglme erimara mudu kaima geglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Ana, na yagl Adam pre diga i, ene prio. Yagl i mabuno swara ta erumara i, yoba mudu bi di kodugwa. Erumere mere kuno yegl, Jisas swara okuo udre, mabuno swara ta erukwa i, ama yoba mudu bi dugwa. Yegl pre Adam ye Jisas okuo udre, kogon erabere piksa mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Adam erukwa i ya Jisas erukwa i, nono mudu bi dugwa ba ye eribrika i, mabunomo pai pere pere edugwa. Adam ye God lomo si biglke dugwa i ya Jisas yoko kaima nono ere wakai ere norukwa i, mabunomo pai pere pere edugwa pre diga. Adam ye God lomo si biglke dumara i, yoba mere kide geglkwa ba Jisas Krais dem muduo yoko kaima norsre, yoba ere yumara i, God yoba yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa mabunomo i, Adam erukwa i egre atne edidre, yoba mere kide ama no bi di kodugwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Na di kodiga. Adam mabunomo i ya God nono yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa mabuno i, pai pere pere edugwa. I siragl pre yagl swara ta God lomo si biglke dumara i mina God yoba mudu dem kubro tedre, ka tage tenagle dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba ye aglke kor yoba ye lomo mere kide si biglke digwa i, ye yoko kaima ere wakai ere tedre, yoba du meglmedi kanugwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Yagl swara ta God lomo si biglke dumara i, geglkwa mabuno ede suna u yoba mudu bi didre, nono bitno mere yegl moglkwa. Ba Jisas Krais kogon podo kide ere, Adam erukwa i egre atne ede togwa. Yegl pre Jisas kogon erumara i, God yoba yoko kaima ere wakai ere tedre, yoba ta ye du meglmedi kanugwa yoba i, ye aimadi kamun kor mogl, Jisas king mogl, taragl mudu sugl morabara i, ye akie sugl moraiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ana na Adam ya Jisas pre diga i, erme di kodinaglka. Yagl Adam swara ere mogl, God lomo si biglke dumara God yoba mudu ka tage tenagledi di padigl kodugwa. Ba yagl swara ta okuo udre, mabuno du mina duglo bogl, kogon swara ta erumara i mina God yoba mudu du meglmedi kandre, ye kor aimadi meglkwa i tenabuka, kuno erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />I siragl pre yagl swara ta God kamo sedumara yoba mere kide ede u tadaglme yoba pi meglkwa ba yagl swara ta God kamo duglo boglsre, kogon erumara i mina yoba mere kide God gumuglo mina yoba du moraiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ana God ere mogl, ye lomo yoba togwa i, yoko ta tekrukwa. Yoba tadaglme erikwa i, podo kide eunedi pre pogl sinaiglkwa pre togwa. Ye lo togwa i yoba prisre, tadaglme siragl mere paugwa i pre kan erikwa ba tadaglme ere ede podo eigwa. Yegl erikwa ba God ye yoba yoko kaima ere yugwa mabunomo i, ama ede u podo kide ogwa. Yoba swara ta tadaglme podo kide eran, God ye ere inabuka ta kuno erekrabedi pramga i ta manugwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Yegl pre nono okna tadaglme mina atne mogl, gunere mere kuno yegl, erme God nono yoba du meglmedi kanugwa pre nono ye yoko kaima ere yugwa mabunomo i mina atne munga. Te, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina nono aimadi kamin kor moramga i, God noro kodugwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Jisas goglmara i, nono God gumuglo mina akie goglsre, adigl u kor omga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ana na ka komono ta diga i, yegl diga, yoba tadaglmeno u podo ogwa ba God ye yoba yoko kaima ere inagledi prukwa mabunomo i ama ede u podo kide kaima ome diga. Yegl pre nono siragl eramne? Nono prumun, God ege ege nono yoko kaima ere wakai ere noro pai morabuka keme paugwa pre nono tadaglme ere pai mun, aglau ta paikrumiwe di, nono yegl prisre, tadaglme aimadi ere pai moramno? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Mabuno yegl ka kaima ta erekramga! Nono Jisas bogl akie gunga pre nono tadaglme mabuno mina atne moglkrumga. Nono tadaglme mabuno mina atne moglkrumga pre tadaglme aimadi ere pai moramga i, kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Nono Jisas bogl gune diga i, ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi prika. Yoba nigl atne eigo, nigl mogl winabo dumere mere yegl, God nono Jisas Krais moglmara i atne kra ede kodugo, atne mogl kodumga pre Jisas goglmara i, nono ye bogl akie gunga mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />God ye nono Jisas bogl i swara edugwa i, nono Jisas goglmara i ye bogl akie goglsre, akie kobuglo mur mina atne pai, ama Jisas bogl akie adigl u kor enaiglmedi erukwa. Krais goglko, God nem ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa i, i nogugl ede, ye ere i kor edumere yegl, nono ama kiano mina ere i kor edugwa pre nono kor moglsre, mabuno kor eramga kuno erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ana nono Jisas bogl u swara omga pre ye goglmere mere yegl nono ama gunga. Nono ye bogl akie gunga pre ye adigl u kor omere yegl nono ama adigl u kor enamga keme paugwa. Ka kaima nono ye bogl akie adigl u kor omga. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Nono prumga, Jisas ede prak mina goglkwa igne, God ye nono okna tadaglme yugobunomo mina atne munga i, ede prak mina si dudugwa. Ye yegl erukwa i, tadaglme yobuglomo dudinan, nono tadaglme niglmo kogonmo erekraiglmedi erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />I siragl pre nono Jisas bogl akie gunga pre nono okna tadaglme mina atne kane pamga i, God ye nono kane pamnara no i meda edugwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ana nono Krais bogl akie gunga pre nono prumga i, nono erme ye bogl akie kor moramga keme paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />I siragl pre Krais goglsre, adigl u kor ogwa i, ye aglke kor ta goglkrabuka, aimadi kamun kor morabuka. I siragl pre geglkwa yobuglomo i ye si dudu kodugwa pre ye aglke kor geglkwa mabuno i mina atne moglkrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Jisas goglkwa i, ye ege swara keme goglsre, tadaglme yobuglomo si dudu kodugwa. Te, ye adigl u kor pidre, erme kor moglkwa i, ye God bogl akie miurka.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ana Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor ogo, God bogl akie miurere yegl, ene ama yegl prio! Krais Jisas goglmara i, nono ye bogl akie gunga pre tadaglme mabuno i mina ta atne moglkrumnedi praiglkwa. Te, Jisas adigl u kor pidre, God bogl akie miurere kuno yegl, nono ama God bogl akie muniwedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ene erme God bogl akie meglkwa pre tadaglme mabuno i ene bitno morabedi kanige erekrio! Nono ogono nagino bogl makandigle munga pre tadaglme mabuno nono bitno mere yegl moran, mabuno kide siragl mere ogono nagino mina pogglau borabuka i, duglo boramga i kuno ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Yegl pre ene ogono nagino tadaglme mabuno duglo boglsre, mabuno kide erabedi kanige erekrio! Ene yegl erekre, enene mudu meglmere God teo. Ene ta praiglkwa i, No goglsre, adigl ede u kor omgra we di prisre, ogono nagino mabuno du erabedi God teo! <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />I siragl pre erme tadaglme mabuno ene bitno morabuka i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Ene lo mina ta atne kra meglbi, kaima tadaglme mabuno ene bitno morabuka paugwa ba ene lo mina atne ta moglkrikwa. God ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere te moglko, ene ye moglmara swara i mina atne meglkwa pre tadaglme mabuno ene erme bitno moglkrabuka i, kuno paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuno du niglmo kogonmo ere tenamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Ana nono erme lo mina ta atne moglkre, God moglmara swara i mina atne munga pre, nono siragl eramne? God no wakai kan kodumedi prisre, tadaglme aimadi ere pai moramno? Kodo! Nono yegl ta erekramga. <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Yoba niglno kogono yoba mabunono i, ene prikwa. Yoba ta niglmo kogonmo ere tenagledi prisre, ye kamo duglo boraluwe dinan, ye kaima yoba i moglmara mogl atne ede, niglmo kogonmo yoba morabuka. Kuno yegl mere, ene tadaglme mabuno duglo bogln, ene tadaglme mabuno mina atne mogl, niglmo kogonmo yoba mere yegl moglsre, goratnga. Ba ene God kamo duglo bogln, ene ye niglmo kogonmo yoba moglsre, mabuno du boratnga. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17-18" />Ba na gun yedre, God di wakai yei teiga i, ene erme tadaglme mabuno niglmo kogonmo yoba moglkrikwa pre God di wakai yei teiga. Ene okna tadaglme mabuno mina atne kane paigwa ba yoba tau Jisas kamo ene beke teigo, ene deno muduno bogl pre mediglkwa. Yegl eriko, God ene tadaglme mina kane paimara i, ene i meda edugo, ene erme mabuno du niglmo kogonmo yoba mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ana na ere mogl, yoba niglno kogono yoba pre ka ebrie diga i, ene pre pogl sinaiglkwa pre diga. Nono makandigle yoba munga i, mabunono yegl paugwa. Ege tau ka tau pre pogl sikrumga ba ka ebrie prumga igne, nomane idre, pre pogl sumga. Ana ene okna ere mogl, ogono nagino mabuno kide ya mabuno deglbi niglmo kogonmo ere tenabedi teigwa. Ene okna yegl erikwa pre mabuno kide mere kide plau dugwa. Yegl erikwa ba erme ene ogono nagino mabuno du niglmo kogonmo erabedi teo! Ene yegl eribi, God mabunomo ta pamere yegl eraiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ene okna tadaglme niglmo kogonmo ere teigwa igne, ene mabuno du i mina atne moglkrikwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ene okna tadaglme mabuno swara i mina atne wan mogl, mabuno kide kane kane erikwa pre erme ene pre ikne edidre, agai geglkwa. Ene okna mabuno kide erimara i mina taragl wakai ta ene meglmara plau dumo? Ta manugwa. Mabuno kide i mina geglkwa mabuno keme plau dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Yegl paugwa ba ene okna tadaglme mina atne kane paigo, God ene i meda edugwa pre erme ene God yobama mogl kodidre, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba meglkwa. Te, ene okuo God bogl aimadi kamun kor moraiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Nono tadaglme ere kodumga pre topomo geglkwa keme inamga paugwa. Topo yegl inamga paugwa ba ta ikunga. I siragl pre God ere mogl, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina, aimadi kamin kor moramga i, yoko kaima noro kodugwa.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Nono lo mina atne moglkunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Agrama abarama wagle, na God lomo pre ene ka tau di tenaglka. Ene God lomo pre kan erikwa pre na ka dinaglka i, ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi prika. Na God lomo pre ka dinaglka i, yegl dinaglka, God lomo i, yoba kor meglkwa i keme bitno moglkwa. Yoba geglkwa i, ye lo mina atne moglkrikwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Na ka ebrie swara ta dibo, pramga. God lomo dugwa i, yagl abu ta bogl ibr, abu i ye wie kor morabuka igne aimadi ye bogl akie morabre dugwa. Ba ye wie goran, abu i lo i mina ta atne moglkrukwa pre ye yoko moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Yegl pre abu wie ta kor moran, ye ede yagl kor ta enan, abu i yagl kunogl nome dinamga. Yegl dinamga ba ye wie ta goran, abu i lo i mina atne moglkre, yoko moglkwa pre ye yagl kor ta enan, ye yagl i kunogl nekrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ana na lo pre diga i, yegl pre diga, Krais ede prak mina goglkwa igne i ene akie geglkwa pre ene erme lo mina atne moglkrikwa. God ene Jisas bogl akie goraiglmedi erukwa i, ene Jisas bogl swara kaima moglsre, akie adigl u kor ebi, God ene mabuno wakai ta boraiglmedi prumere yegl, ene boraiglkwa pre erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Nono okna deno muduno goglo pamara i mina atne munga igne, God lomo prumga ba nono prisre, duglo boglkunga. God lomo tadaglme pre dugwa i nono prisre, tadaglme keme poglo di pre, ere ede podo enamnedi punga. Tadaglme kane kane munara pogglau boglko, nono ogono nagino mina tadaglme kane kane ersre, kiano mina gogl kodumga. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ba erme we, Jisas goglmara i nono akie gunga pre lo mina atne moglkrumga. Okna lo mina atne kane pamga ba God nono i meda edugo, erme lo mina kane paikre, yoko munga. Nono okna God kogonmo eramnedi erumga i, ye lomo bogl atne edimara i duglo bogl, kogonmo eramnedi erumga ba erme nono kogon yegl eramnedi erumga i kide kodo, ye Murubuglomo swara yobuglo bogl noran, God kogonmo kaima eramga pre God nono i meda edugwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">God lomo i, nono tadaglmeno i nogugl edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Yegl paugwa pre God lomo kide yome dinamno? Ka kaima yegl ta dikramga. I siragl pre ye lomo i mina nono tadaglme mabuno siragl mere paugwa i pre kan erumga. God lomo, Bubuno goglkrio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isp Kide Kodigwa 20.17, Lo 5.21</char></note>ta dikruma, na mabuno kide ta erekriedi priko. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Yegl pre God lomo Yoba pere taraglno bubuno goglkrio dugwa i, wakai dugwa ba na lo i prika igne, tadaglme mabuno na moglmara atne paugwa i kogon podo ere, na taragl kane kane bubuno goratnedi eruko, na bubuno goglka. I siragl pre lo ta paikrukwa igne, tadaglme yobuglomo ta paikrukwa ba lo paugwa igne, tadaglme yobuglomo paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Ana na okna God lomo kaima pre pogl sikrika igne, kor mogl, wakai moglka. Yegl erika ba okuo na God lomo siragl mere dugwa i pre pogl siga igne, tadaglme yobuglo ere, na si goglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />God lomo i, yoba duglo beglbi, kor moraiglkwa pre yogwa ba na duglo boglkrika pre God lomo na moglmara i, geglkwa mabuno i nogugl ede narukwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />I siragl pre God lomo yegl dumiwedi tadaglme na bakagl nare, na ake nu si, na si goglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga. God lomo ya ye siragl mere erio didre, erekrio dugwa i, yene dugwa pre wakai pai, du paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ana na diga, God lomo wakai yome diga ba na ka ta ama diga i, God lomo na moglmara i, geglkwa mabuno i nogugl edume diga. Yegl pre siragl we dinamne? God lomo na si goglme dinamno? Ka kaima yegl ta dikramga. Tadaglme na si goglkwa. Tadaglme ere mogl, God lomo yegl yegl dumiwedi, na si biglke dinabedi ake nu si, na si goglkwa. Te, God ye tadaglme na moglmara kogon siragl mere ta erabuka i erabedi kanige erukwa i, na God lomo mina nomane idre, tadaglme i taragl kide kaima yomedi kanaglka pre kanige erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tadaglme ta erekramnedi punga i, eunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ana nono prumga, God lomo i, God yene di norukwa pre wakai yogwa. God lomo wakai yogwa ba na makandigle yoba moglka. Na yobuglna paikrukwa pre tadaglme yobuglo ere mogl, na si kane sugo, na tadaglme niglmo kogonmo ere teiga. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Na mabuno tau erika i, siragl pre erie? di, kinana gudu moglka. I siragl pre na mabuno tau eragledi prika i, erekre, mabuno tau kide pre, erakiurka i erika. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Na mabuno kide erekragledi prika pre na God lomo wakai yomedi prika i, nogugl paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Yegl pre na kaniga mabuno kide i, na nana ta erekrika ba tadaglme na dena muduna mina suna paugwa i, erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />I siragl pre na pre kan erika i, na dena muduna goglo paugwa i mina taragl wakai swara kaima ta paikrukwa. Na mabuno wakai keme eragledi prika ba na yobuglna ta paikrukwa pre na ta erekrika. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Na di kodiga, na mabuno wakai eragledi prika i erekre, mabuno kide na ta erekragledi prika i, na erika. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ba na kaniga, nana mabuno tau erakiurika i erika pre na nana erekrika ba tadaglme na dena muduna mitna atne paugwa i erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ana na mabuno yegl mere paugo, kaniga, na mabuno wakai eragledi prika ba mabuno kide ama magigl mogl, na yobuglo ere narukwa mere yegl pamedi kaniga. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />I siragl pre na nomana mina God lomo wakai kaima yomedi prika. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Yegl prika ba na ama kaniga i, tadaglme mabuno ogona nagna mina atne pai mogl, na nomana mina kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo ere, na si kane sumedi kaniga. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24-25" />Aya! Na yagl kide kaima ta moglka. Na nomana mina God lomo mina atne mogl, dugl boragledi prika ba na dena muduna goglo paugwa i, tadaglme mabuno mina atne moglkwa pre tadaglme keme eratnedi prukwa. Na erme ogona nagna gogl, burabuka i mina atne kane pai, tadaglme ere moglka. Ira na ere inabe? Na God di wakai yei teiga i, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina na ere i kodugwa pre di wakai yei teiga.<verse eid="ROM 7:24-25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Mudu Murubuglo nono ere i kor edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Yegl pre Krais Jisas kogon erumara atne kra meglkwa i, God ka ta tage tekrabuka. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />I siragl pre okna tadaglme ya geglkwa lomo mina kane pamga i, Mudu Murubuglo lomo nono i meda edugo, fri munga. Mudu Murubuglo lomo i, Krais Jisas kogon erumara kiano ere i kor edugwa lomo yogwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nono deno muduno goglo bogl munga pre God lomo nono ere inabuka kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa ba God yene Wam tadaglme kumap tenabedi dedidre, nono ere yugwa. Ye Wam tadaglme yoba ogono nagino kunere koglko, God ye ka tage tedre, tadaglme yobuglomo si dudugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Si dudugwa i, God lomo mabuno du pre dugwa i, nono deno muduno goglo duglo boglkre, Mudu Murubuglo duglo bun, munara plau dinabuka pre si dudugwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Deno muduno goglo duglo beglkwa yoba i, pogglau boglkwa igne, taragl kane kane i eramnedi nomano si gigle digwa. Ba Mudu Murubuglo duglo beglkwa yoba i, ye eraiglmedi prumere i, eramniwe di nomano si gigle digwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Te, yoba deno muduno goglo duglo boramnedi nomano si gigle digwa i, geglkwa plau dugwa. Te, Mudu Murubuglo duglo boramnedi nomano si gigle digwa i, kor meglkwa ya deno muduno wida dugwa i, plau dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Deno muduno goglo duglo boramnedi prikwa i, God kuda bogl teigwa. I siragl pre ye nomane yegl igwa i, God lomo mina atne moraiglkwa kuno erekrukwa. Te, ye ama God lomo duglo boglkraiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Yegl paugwa pre yoba deno muduno goglo duglo bogl meglkwa i, God ye wakai kankrabuka.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />God Murubuglomo ene meglmara kaima moran, ene deno muduno goglo mina atne moglkre, Mudu Murubuglo moglmara atne kra meglkwa. Ba Krais Murubuglomo yoba ta moglmara atne moglkran, ye Krais yobamo ta moglkrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ene tadaglme erikwa pre ogono nagino gorabuka ba Krais ene meglmara suna moran, God gumuglo mina yoba du meglkwa pre Mudu Murubuglo ene ere i kor edugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ene ogono gagno gorabe diga i, kaima diga ba God, ye Krais Jisas goglko, ere i kor edugwa God i, ye Murubuglomo ene meglmara atne moglkwa pre okuo ye ene ogono nagino ama ere i kor ede tenabuka.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nono Mudu Murubuglo kamo duglo boramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Agrama abarama wagle, Mudu Murubuglo nono munara atne moglkwa pre nono kogono paugwa. Ba deno muduno goglo kogonmo ere tedre, duglo boramga ta manugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />I siragl pre ene deno muduno goglo i ta duglo bogl meglbi, ene goraiglkwa. Yegl eraiglkwa ba ene God Murubuglo ene di tomere yegl ere, mabuno kide ogono nagino mina erikwa i kide kodibi, ene wakai moraiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Mudu Murubuglo Owo di teigwa i, ye kaima God gagiglema meglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />God Murubuglo nono munara ugwa i, nono ere i God gagiglma edenagledi ugwa. Nono erme God gagiglma mogl kodumga pre ye nono aglke kor kane pai, kudugl goraiglmedi prikrukwa. Te, nono God gagiglma munga i pre nono erme God agle didre, Nina yo! we dumga i, kuno erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Nono God gagiglma munga i, God Murubuglo nono nomano mina di noro, Ene God gagiglma meglmiwe di, yegl di noruko, prumga. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Te, God gagiglma munga pre God ye gagiglma taragl wakai kane kane inaiglmedi di paduglkwa i, ka kaima inamga. Krais okna yubun idre, giugl prumere yegl, nono erme ama yubun idre, giugl tau akie prumun, okuo nono Jisas abuglagemo sumara ye bogl akie moglsre, taragl wakai kane kane Jisas bogl akie inamga.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nono okuo heven ibo wakai kaima moramga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ka kaima erme nono yubun idre, giugl tau prumga ba i taragl kebra yogwa. I siragl pre taragl wakai kane kane God okuo i nogugl ede norabuka i, taragl podo kide paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Te, God taragl kane kane ere yogwa i, God ye gagiglma siragl mere okuo wakai moraiglkwa i, ye i nogugl edenabedi sugl mogl, kwie ere meglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20-21" />I siragl pre okuo i, taragl kane kane God ere yogwa i, u wakai enabuka. Okna taragl kane kane God ere yogwa u kide ogwa i, taragl i yene u kide enagledi prikrukwa ba tadaglme plau dugwa igne God yene di kide yei togwa. Makandigle taragl kane kane God di kide yei tomara atne paigwa pre taragl mudu gogl, kide eraiglkwa keme paugwa. Yegl paugwa pre God di kide yei tomara taragl mudu atne kane pai meglkwa i kide kodo, ede meda enamnedi sugl meglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Okuo God ye gagiglma wakai kaima moraiglmedi i nogugl edenabuka igne, ye taragl mudu ere yogwa i ama u wakai kaima enabuka pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 8:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />God okna dumo makan di kide yei togwa igne i ede u ege erme pra, taragl kane kane paigwa i ye abu gak kuramnedi gagno giugl primere yegl taragl i mudu u wakai enamnba di giugl pre, gigln akin di, kwie ere meglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Te, nono ama deno muduno mina giugl prisre, gign akin dumga. God nono taragl wakai kane kane okuo norabuka pre ye Murubuglomo komono kana noruko, yumga. Yegl erukwa ba nono erme makandigle munga igne, giugl prisre, yubun i pai munga pre nono kwie ere mogl, God nono ye gagiglma munga i agre i ede heven ibo pidre, ogono nagino kor padigl norabedi sugl munga.<verse eid="ROM 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />God nono ere i kodugwa pre nono erme taragl wakai kane kane okuo inamga pre kwie ere munga. Nono makandigle taragl erme kandre, yumga i, inamnedi sugl moramga ta kuno erekrukwa. I kodumga pre inamnedi sugl moglkrumga. <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ba nono heven ibo taragl ta ikrumga i, inamnedi kwie ere sugl munga pre nono oglka erekre, sugl mogl pai moramga keme paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ana God Murubuglo nono ege ege ake ple di norukwa. I siragl pre nono yoba munga i, yobuglno ta paikrukwa. Ege mere nono kamage ere, God ka siragl mere di pramga i, pre pogl sikrumga. Pre pogl sikrumga ba God Murubuglo yene ere mogl, nono mitno podo goglsre, gigln akin di, nono kano i pi God di togwa. Kano i pi God di togwa i, nono ka drano mina dikre, nomano mina keme gigln akin dumga ba God Murubuglo nono kano i pi God di togwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />God Murubuglo nono God yobama munga i kamage ere norukwa i, yene pre kan erumere kamage erekrukwa ba God Nem ta pre kan erumere yegl, ye agle di prukwa. Yegl pre God ye nono nomano ya deno muduno kan pogl sugwa moglkwa i, ye ama God Murubuglo nono pre ye agle di togwa i pre pogl sugwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ana God yene prumere nono agle dugo, nono erme ye yobama moglsre, deno muduno God tomga yoba munga. Ye yobama munga i, taragl kane kane kide ya wakai akie nono munara plau dugwa ba taragl kane kane plau dumara i, God ege ege nono ere wakai keme ere norukwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Okna kaima ibo, yoba ira ta God konbauna sinabara mina unaiglkwa i, ye pre kan ere kodidre, yoba i ye Wam moglmere mere yegl moraiglmedi di padigl kodugwa. Ye prukwa i, Jisas nono agro komono mere yegl moran, nono ye agiglema abaugloma mere kide moraiglmedi prukwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Te, God yoba ira ta Jisas moglmere mere yegl moraiglmedi di paduglkwa i, ye yoba i agle dugwa. Te, God yoba ta agle dugo, wigwa i, ye yoba du meglmedi kandre, ye gumuglo mina yoba i agre i pi heven ibo, ye abuglagemo sumara i, ede kodugwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">God nono dem muduo podo norukwa i, taragl swara ta si kegl dikrabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ana God nono yegl mere ere wakai ere norsre, nono munara mogl norukwa pre nono pre yubun dekramga. Yoba nono kudano ikne mere yegl mogl, ere kide ere noramnedi eraiglkwa ba God nono munara mogl norukwa pre i ta eribi, kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Te, ene prio! God okna ere mogl, yene Wam ake gi dikre, nono mudu pre gorabedi dedugwa. Taragl podo yegl ere kodugwa pre nono taragl kane kane ta inamga panabara i, God ama yoko kaima norabuka keme paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Te, God nono kere i pere edidre, nono kanugwa i, yoba du meglmedi kan kodugwa. Yegl pre yoba ta ere mogl, ogono buglo sidre, Yoba i kide meglmiwe dinaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Krais Jisas nono pre goglsre, adigl u kor pidre, ye erme God ogo wo kra mogl, nono kano di moglkwa pre yoba ta ere mogl, Yoba i ye tadaglmeno pre ka tage inaiglmiwe di, yegl ta dinaiglkwa i ama kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Krais dem muduo podo kide norukwa pre taragl swara ta ye dem muduo podo norukwa i si kegl dinabuka kuno erekrukwa. Yubun unabuka mo giugl pramga mo yoba ta no ere kide ere noraiglkwa i, i mina ta si kegl dikraiglkwa. Te, kidan yenabuka mo kuguglno gaglno ta manabuka mo taragl kane kane no sinamnedi eraiglkwa mo ka kaima no sinaiglkwa i mina, Jisas nono dem muduo podo norukwa i ta si kegl dikraiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Nono ka kaima yubun tau yegl mere inamga i pre God kamo mina okna ibo yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">God yo, no ene yobanma munga pre yoba ege ege no si goramnedi erikwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Ye no kanigwa i, ye sipsip ta si goraiglkwa mere yegl meglmedi no kanimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 44.22 </char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 8:36">di, God kamo yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Taragl kane kane yegl plau dinabuka ba Jisas yene dem muduo podo norsre, yobuglo bogl norukwa pre taragl i nono ta si atne edekrabuka. Ka kaima ta manabuka. Nono ege ege yobuglo eramga.<verse eid="ROM 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38-39" />Ana God nono dem muduo podo norukwa i, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina i nogugl ede norukwa. Te, na pre gi diga i, ye dem muduo podo norukwa i, taragl swara kaima ta si kegl dikrabuka. Nono goramno mo kor moramga i ta si kegl dikrabuka. God dem muduo podo norukwa i, aimadi pai morabuka. Te, angelo mo murubuglo kide mo yoba kade ta ere mogl, God dem muduo podo norukwa i ta si kegl dinagledi erabuka ba i kuno kaima ta erekrabuka. Taragl erme plau dugwa mo okuo ta plau dinabuka i, i ama ta si kegl dikrabuka. Te, kamun mitna ibo mo makan atne taragl meglkwa mo paigwa i mudu ta si kegl dikraiglkwa. God taragl kane kane ere yogo, paigwa ya meglkwa i, swara kaima ta ere mogl, ye dem muduo norukwa i ta si kegl dikraiglkwa. God nono ege ege dem muduo podo noro pai morabuka keme paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:38-39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">God ye Israel yoba keme ere ikre, yugobuno pere pere ama ere yugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1-2" />Na erme ka dinaglka i, Krais gumuglo mina ka kaima di teiga. Te, , Israel yoba mere kide Jisas pre mediglkrikwa i pre na dena muduna ege ege yubun dogo, na ege ege kide pre, ye mitno podo kide goglka. Na ka diga i, ka kibi dikrika. Ka kaima diga i, Mudu Murubuglo ama kan pogl sugo, nana nomana mina ama pre kan erika. <verse eid="ROM 9:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Na prika i, Israel yoba, na bogl bormai swara munga i, ye mudu pre medigl, Krais pre medunga yoba munara ede suna unaiglkwa i swara wakai panabuka. Na taragl swara ta eribo, ye mudu ede suna unaiglkwa i, na kaima eraglka. Na swara ede meda pidre, doga kade debo, Israel yoba mudu na againana idre, ede suna unaiglkwa mere panan, na pra we dinaglka. Yegl dinaglka ba God mabunomo yegl ta paikrukwa pre kuno ta erekrabuka.<verse eid="ROM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Israel yoba meglkwa i, ye tau mere pre mediglkrikwa ba God ye kaima ere wakai ere togwa pre ye mudu pre medraiglkwa i, kuno erukwa. God ye Israel ere wakai ere togwa i, ye na gagrama mere yegl moraiglmedi kere i pere edidre, ye abuglagemo kanaiglmedi ama i nogugl ede togwa. Yegl ersre, ye ama Israel yoba ka kaima tau mere di te padiglsre, ye lomo tedre, ye Na yuguna kei naraiglmiwe di, yegl di togwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop ki okna ibo meglkwa i, ye Israel yoba kowano awano meglkwa. Te, Krais Jisas ede makandigle u yoba moglkwa i, ye ama Israel yoba ta moglkwa. Krais ye God moglsre, taragl mudu nem yagl moglkwa pre nono ye kagie kade aimadi kamun tenamga paugwa. Ka kaima.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ana God ye Israel yoba ka kaima tau mere di te padiglsre, ye ere wakai ere tenagle dugwa ba erme Israel yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglkre, meda meglkwa. Yegl paugwa pre God ye okna ka kaima tau Israel yoba di te paduglkwa i, ka dumere erabo mo erekrabe? God ye dumere ere, Israel yoba kaima ta meglkwa i, ere wakai ere tenabuka ba Israel yoba mudu meglkwa i, tau God kamo pre mediglsre, Israel yoba kaima meglkwa ba tau God kamo pre mediglkre, Israel yoba kaima mere yegl moglkrikwa. Yegl pre ye tau pre mediglkwa i keme ere wakai ere tenabuka. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Israel yoba mudu Abraham gawama meglkwa ba ye Abraham gawama meglmara i pre ye Israel yoba kaima ta moglkre, te God gagiglma ama ta moglkrikwa. I nogugl paugwa, Abraham okna ibo yagl gak suo kuglkwa ba God ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Na ene gawanma mere moraiglme diga ikra, wan Aisak swara i ye wama ya gawama pre diwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 21.12</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Abraham ye yagl gak tau yene kuglkwa i, ye gawama okuo mogl eigwa i, God ye Abraham gawama meglmedi kankrukwa ba Abraham wam ta, God ka kaima di te paduglmara mina Abraham okuo kuglkwa, kagie Aisak we digwa i, ye gawama okuo mogl eigwa i keme Abraham gawama meglmedi kanugwa. Kuno yegl mere yoba ogono nagino mina Abraham gawama meglmara i pre ye God gagiglma ta moglkrikwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />God ye ka kaima ta Abraham di te padigl, wam ta kurabuka pre dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Na bugla yugu swara ta mogl, aglke ede ikne unaglka. Sara komono kana wam ta kuran, na unaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 18.10</char></note> di, God ye Aisak swara pre yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ana God ye Aisak gawama i keme Israel yoba moraiglmedi kere yumere mere yegl, ye ama Rebeka wam suo, Jekop ya Iso miurara i, ye Jekop gawama keme Israel yoba moraiglmedi kere yugwa. Iso gawama kere ikrukwa. No Israel yoba kowano awano Aisak i, ye yagl gak Jekop ya Iso i suo akie kuglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" />Suo akie kuglkwa ba God ere mogl, yene yoba tau Israel yoba moraiglmedi kere inagledi prumere gak swara keme kere yugwa. Gak pikagl suo i, mano ye kuglkrukwa igne God ere mogl, ye mano di te, yegl dugwa, Gak ta komono kuratnga i, ye gawama ere mogl, gak ta okuo kuratnga gawama i, niglno kogono ere tenaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.11-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 25.23</char></note> dugwa. Igne i, yagl gak suo i Rebeka dane mina atne miurka pre ye mabuno wakai mo mabuno kide ta boglkribrika. Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga i, God ye Jekop gawama keme kere yugwa i, yagl gak suo i ebrie mabunono kandre, kere ikrukwa ba yene prumere kere yugwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Te, God ye okna ibo Jekop gawama i keme Israel yoba moraiglmedi kere yugwa i, kaima yegl plau dugwa. God kamo kep yoba ta okuo ere mogl, God kamo bage ta yegl boglkwa, Na Jekop gawama wakai kaniga ba Iso gawama i, na kide kaniwe di, God yegl dumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malakai 1.2-3</char></note> di, yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ana nono siragl we dinamne? God ye Abraham gawama tau Israel yoba moraiglmedi kere idre, tau kere ikrukwa i, mabuno kide erume dinamno? Ta manugwa. God ye ege ege mabuno du keme erukwa pre ka kaima yegl ta dikramga. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />God ye okna Moses di togwa, Na yoba ta mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tenagledi praglka i, kaima mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tenaglka. Na nana wagle pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 33.19</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga, yoba ta ere mogl, God na ere wakai ere narabedi prabuka mo kogon wakai ta erabuka i pre God ye ere wakai ere tekrabuka ba God ye yene yoba mitno goglsre, ta ere wakai ere tenagledi prabuka i, yene prumere erabuka.<verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Te, God ye yoba ta ere kide ere tenagledi prukwa i, ama ye wagle paugwa. God kamo mina God ye okna ibo Isip kingno yegl di tome dugwa, Na ene king moratnedi kere iga i, na yobuglna ene mina i nogugl edibo, yoba kanibi, na kagna uglo kogl koglo wanabuka i pre kere iwe di, God yegl dume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 9.16</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga. God ye yoba ta mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tenagledi prukwa i, ere wakai ere togwa ba ye yoba ta nomanemo kide paugwa i nomane kor i dinabedi si gigle di tenagledi prukwa i ama si gigle di togwa. Ye moglmara i paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ana na diga i, God yene yoba ta ere wakai ere tenagledi prabuka mo nomane kor i dinabedi si gigle di tenagledi prabuka mo i, ye mina pame diga. Yegl pre na prika. Yoba ta ka i prisre, yegl dinabuka, Yegl eran, yoba ta God kamo prikramnedi nomano gigle dinabuka i, ye yene aglau erekrikwa. God yene prumere ka di paduglmara keme erikwa pre God aglau erume di, yegl dinabuka. Yegl dinabuka ba i ta kuno erekrukwa. God aglau ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Makandigle yoba ta ere mogl, God ye ere yogwa i ka tedre, Ene na kide moratnedi beke yeniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 29.16, 45.9</char></note> di, yegl ta dinabuka i, kuno erumo? Kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />God ye nono ere yogwa pre ye nem yagl moglkwa. Yegl pre ye siragl mere ere noragledi prabuka i, ye mina paugwa. Yoba ta makan koglwa idre, makan gaba sin ta bekenabuka i, ye nem yagl moglkwa pre ye sin swara ta kogon wakai pre bekidre, sin ta kogon kide pre bekidre, erabuka i, ye mina paugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Potter" file="LB00138b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="9.21" /> <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />God ye nono yoba mudu siragl mere ere noragledi prabuka i, erabuka keme paugwa ba ye mabuno kide ta ere norokrukwa. Nono yoba mudu mabuno wakai ere norukwa. Yoba tau yene doga denamnedi erikwa pre God dem kubro tedre, ka tage tenan inaiglkwa yoba i, God ye yobuglomo ya dem kubro togwa i kaima i nogugl edenagledi pra we dugwa ba ye tabre ka tage tekrukwa. Ye yoba i nomane kor inaiglmedi kanana sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />God yegl ersre, te ye ama yoba ta nono mitno goglsre, nono ere yugwa munga i, ye abuglagemo podo kide i, i nogugl ede norukwa. Okna kaima ibo ye abuglagemo sumara i mina nono akie moramnedi di padigl kodugwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />God ye nono akie moramnedi di padigl kodidre, nono agle dugo, umga. Ye nono agle dugwa i, Juda yoba keme agle dikrukwa ba yoba meda, yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i ama agle dugo, akie ede suna umga.<verse eid="ROM 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ana God ye Israel yoba keme agle dikre, yugobuno pere pere ama agle dugwa i, kuno erukwa. I siragl pre ye okna ibo ka ta dugo, ye kamo kep yagl ta kagie Hosea we digwa i, yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Yoba tau meda mogl, na yobanama moglkrikwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">na ere mogl, Na yobanama meglmiwe dinaglka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Te, yoba tau na okna dena muduna tekrika i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">na dena muduna tenaluwe di, yegl dume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosea 2.23</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Te, Hosea ka ta ama yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">God yegl dugwa, Yoba pere, dumo bage tau meglkwa, ye na yobanama moglkrime diga i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">yoba swara i na God Kor Aimadi moglka i ye di te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">Ene na gagrama meglmiwe di, yegl dinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosea 1.10</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:26">di, God yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ana Israel yoba suom ta Jisas pre mediglkwa pre diga i, ama God kamo okna dumere mere kuno paugwa. Okna God kamo kep yagl Aisaia i, Israel yoba pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">Israel yoba pikaugl mere yegl, mere kide moraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">ba God suom keme ta ere inabuka.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ye yoba kuri ta ere idre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">tau ta moraiglkwa i tabre ka tage te kodinabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 10.22-23</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:28">di, Aisaia yegl dugwa <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Te, okna ibo Aisaia ka ta ama yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">Yagl Kade God, ye yobuglomo podo kide paugwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">ye nono Israel yoba yugobunono mina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">yoba suom ta kanige erukwa i erekruma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">nono Sodom ya Gomora yoba okna ibo mudu geglmere mere yegl gungo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 1.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:29">we di, Aisaia yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel yoba mere ye Jisas pre mediglkrikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ana na Israel yoba ya yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa pre diga i, yegl pre diga, yoba yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i, ye kogon podo erekre, mabuno du ta duglo boglkrikwa. Ye mabuno kide kane kane erikwa ba ye meglmara suna yoba tau pre mediglkwa i, ye pre mediglmara swara i mina God ye yoba du meglmedi kanugwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Te, Israel yoba we, ye tau mere ere mogl, No God lomo duglo bun, God no yoba du meglmedi kanabiwe di, yegl di prisre, God lomo duglo boramnedi erikwa ba ye erimara i, God ye yoba du meglmedi kankrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />God ye Israel yoba du meglmedi kankrukwa i, i siragl pre ye pre mediglbi, God ye yoba du meglmedi kanabuka i, ye ta prikrikwa. Ye prikwa i, no nono mabuno wakai eramnara i mina yoba du moramniwe di prikwa. Israel yoba yegl prikwa pre ye Jisas kamo prikwa ba pre mediglkrikwa. Kobuglo ta konbauna suna paugo, yoba kobuglo i kaglno sidre, yage simere mere yegl, ye Jisas kamo pre mediglkrikwa pre yage sigwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Okna ibo God kamo mina ye kamo kep yoba ta mem swara i pre yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ene kanio! Na Yagl ta dumo Jerusalem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka beglkwa magigl i, dumo kagie Saion we digwa. Ba kagie Saion i, dumo Jerusalem kagie ta paugwa.</char></note> unabedi dedenaglka i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ye kobuglo ta konbauna suna paugwa mere yegl morabuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Yoba ta kobuglo kaglno sidre, yage simere mere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">yoba ta ye pre mediglkraiglkwa i yage sinaiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Yegl paugwa ba yoba ta ye pre medraiglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ye yoba i kaima ere inabuka pre ye kide ta prikraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 8.14, 28.16</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:33">di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="s">Yoba Jisas kamo prisre keme pre medraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna mina prika i, Israel yoba mudu Jisas pre mediglbi, God ye ere inan, wakai panabedi prika. Yegl prika pre na Israel yoba pre kamage ere moglka. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Na Israel yoba pre ka nogugl dinaglka i, ye kaima God kamo duglo boramnedi kogon podo ere meglkwa ba ye God kamo siragl mere paugwa i ye ka kaima ta pre kan erekrikwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Yoba ye God gumuglo mina yoba du moraiglmedi konbauna ta yauro norukwa i, Israel yoba ta pre kan erekre, ye Mabuno wakai duglo boramnara i yoba du moramnedi prikwa. Yegl prikwa pre God yoba du moraiglmedi konbauna si norukwa i mina ukrikwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />God lomo dumere i, Krais ere kodugo, dudugwa. Yegl pre yoba ta lo duglo boglsre, ye yoba du morabuka i ta kuno erekrukwa ba yoba ta Jisas pre medraiglkwa swara i, God gumuglo mina yoba du moraiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Ana yoba God lomo duglo boglsre, God gumuglo mina yoba du moramnedi praiglkwa i pre Moses okna ibo ka ta yegl boglkwa, Yoba ta God lomo mudu duglo boran, ye kor morabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba Kogon Erikwa 18.5</char></note> di, Moses ka yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Yegl pre yoba lo duglo boglsre, kor morabuka panan, lo i mudu ege ege duglo borabuka paugwa ba yoba ta pre medraiglmara mina yoba du moraiglkwa i, kuno erukwa. I siragl pre Jisas kogon mudu ere kodugwa. God kamo bage swara ta mem i pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:6">Ene praiglkwa, Ira ede heven ibo pidre, Krais dokidre, agre yunabe? di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:6">deno muduno mina yegl praiglkwa ba i kuno ta erekrukwa. Siragl pre ye kade u kodugwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Te, ene ama praiglkwa, Ira ede makan atne pidre, Krais ere i kor edenan, adigl unabe? di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:7">ene yegl praiglkwa i, ama kuno erekrukwa. Siragl pre God ye ere i kor ede kodumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pol ye God kamo bage ta idre, dugwa i, Lo 30.12 idre, dugwa, ba ye God Kere Yugwa yagl kagie i suna edidre, ye u kodugwa ya God ye ere i kor ede kodugwa i ama i suna edugwa.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:7">di, God kamo yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Te, no yoba Jisas kamo pre medraiglmedi di wan munga i, yoba prisre, pre medraiglkwa i kuno erukwa. I siragl pre God kamo ama yegl dugwa, God kamo eglke yenan, ene pre pogl sikraiglkwa mere yegl ta manga. Ene deno muduno mina pre pogl sidre, drano mina God kamo di wan meglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 30.14</char></note> di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ana yoba ta ere mogl, Jisas ye Yagl Kade moglmiwe didre, nomane mina Jisas ye goglko, God ye ere i kor edumedi pre, pre medran, God yoba i ere inabuka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />I siragl pre yoba ta dem muduo mina Jisas kamo pre medrabuka i, God ye yoba du moglmedi kanabuka. Te, ye dra mina didre, Jisas pre mediluwe dinan, God yoba i ere inabuka. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Mem swara i pre God kamo bage ta yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ere mogl, God Yagl ta dedenan, unabuka i ta pre mediglbi, God yoba i ka kaima ere inabuka pre ye kide ta prikraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 28.16</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Juda yoba munga i mo yugobuno pere meda meglkwa i pra, God swara nono mudu Yaglno Kade moglsre, yoba ira ta ye agle digwa i, kogon podo ersre, ake ple di togwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Mem i pre God kamo bage ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ere mogl, Yagl Kade na ere inabedi, agle dinan, ye kaima ere inabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joel 2.32</char></note> di,God kamo yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ye ere inabuka ba ye pre mediglbi keme agle dinaiglkrawa. Te ka wakai ta prekribi, ye siragl mere pre medraiglme? Te ka wakai praiglkwa i, yoba pi dikribi, ta prekraiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Te yoba ka praiglmedi yoba ta dedekribi, ye siragl mere pi dinaiglme? Yegl pre God kamo bage ta okna beglkwa i mina yegl beglkwa, Yoba ta God kamo wakai i, i pi yoba pere ta di teigwa i, wakai kaima pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 52.7</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ana Jisas kamo wakai i, yoba ede bage bage pi, yoba di teigwa ba yoba tau prisre, mane digwa. God kamo kep yagl Aisaia okna mem i pre yegl boglkwa, Yagl Kade yo, no ene kanen i pi yoba di tomga ba ye pre mediglkrimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 53.1</char></note> di, yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Nono Krais kamo yoba di tenamga i, yoba tau prisre, mane dinaiglkwa ba yoba tau pre medraiglkwa i, konbauna swara keme yogwa. Nono Krais kamo di tomun, ye prisre, pre medraiglkwa. Ba ta di tekrumun, ta prikraiglkwa pre ye ta pre medraiglkwa i kuno erekrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ana Israel yoba we, ye Jisas kamo primo mo prikrime? Ye prikwa. God kamo bage ta yegl dugwa, Yoba God kamo digwa i, wai di ede pi uglo kogl koglo omiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 19.4</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Yegl pre Israel yoba ama ye Jisas kamo prikwa. Ye prikwa ba ye pre pogl simo mo sikrimo? Ye Jisas kamo prisre, pre pogl sigwa ba ye pre pogl sidre, yene mane digwa. God okna ibo Israel yoba yegl eraiglmedi ka ta dugo, Moses bogl atne edugwa i, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Na yugobuno pere pere ere wakai ere tebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ene Israel yoba kandre, deno muduno u kide enan, kide praiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Yugobuno tau ye nomano ta paikrumedi ene prikwa i, na kaima ere wakai ere tenaglka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">Ere wakai ere tebo, ene deno kubraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 32.21</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:19">di, God ye yegl dumiwe di, Moses yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />God ye yugobuno pere pere ere wakai ere tenabuka i pre yagl Aisaia okna ibo God dra idre, ka giglede yegl boglkwa, Yoba bina na doko kankrikwa ba na nana na kanaiglmedi obuno di teiga, kanimiwe di, God yegl dumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 65.1</char></note> di, Aisaia yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Aisaia ye yugobuno pere, meda pre yegl boglsre, Israel yoba pre ama yegl boglkwa, Na ege ege Israel yoba na moglka unaiglmedi agle di moglka ba ye na kana sedidre, duglo boglkrime di, God yegl dumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 65.2</char></note> di, yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Israel yoba tau pre medigl pai meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ana Israel yoba mere kide ye God mokono tedre, God ye konbauna ta si norumara i mina ukrikwa. Ye yegl erikwa ba God ye ka kaima Israel yoba moko te kodokrukwa. Israel yoba tau we, God kamo pre mediglsre, ye God yobama mogl pai meglkwa. Nana ama Israel yoba moglsre, God kamo pre mediglka pre God yobama meglmara i moglka. Na Abraham gawamo ta moglsre, Benjamin yugobunomo mina moglka.<verse eid="ROM 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Israel yoba tau mere ye Jisas kamo ta pre mediglkrikwa i, God okna ibo ye yegl eraiglmedi pre kan ere kodugwa ba ye Israel yoba moko tekrukwa. Erme Israel yoba suom ta God kamo pre mediglmere kuno yegl, okna ibo ama yegl paugwa. God kamo kep yagl Elaija moglkwa igne, ye ama suom keme pre mediglkwa pre Elaija ye Israel yoba erikwa i kide prisre, God di togwa i, God kamo mina yegl paugwa, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Yagl Kade yo, Israel yoba meglkwa i, ene kanen prikrikwa. Ye ene kanen kep yoba mudu si goglsre, tawa bogl ene tawa gagl tenamnedi yoba okna kiglkwa i ama si guru di atne edigwa. Na swara na ene mokona tekrika ba ye erme na ama na si goramnedi ere meglmiwe di, Elaija yegl dumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel Yoba Kingno Buk 1 19.10, 19.14</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ana Elaija ye God ka yegl di togwa ba God siragl mere di ikne edugwa i, ene pre meglmo? Ye yegl dugwa, Ene pitnga, Israel yoba mudu kaima God mokono teimedi pitnga ba i kuno erekrukwa. Kaima Israel yoba mere kide mokono narsre, god kibi ta kagie Bal we digwa i, kagie kade teigwa ba ye mudu mokono narekrikwa. Na yobanama, mokono ta narekrikwa i, yoba 7,000 mogl pai meglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel Yoba Kingno Buk 1 19.18</char></note> di, God yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ana God okna ibo Israel yoba kowano awano yoko kaima ere wakai ere tedre, ye kere i pere ede kodugwa pre Israel yoba mudu God mokono tenaiglkwa i kuno erekrukwa. Ye mere God mokono tenaiglkwa ba suom ta pre medigl pai moraiglkwa. Elaija moglkwa igne, Israel yoba suom ta pre medigl pai meglmere yegl, erme ama Israel yoba swarade God mokono tekre, pre medigl meglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ana na diga, God ye okna ibo Israel yoba yoko kaima ere wakai tome diga ba God ye yoba yoko kaima ere wakai ere tome dumga i, nono pre pogl sinamga. Yoba mabuno wakai ta erukwa pre God ye ere wakai ere tenan, i mabuno pere paugwa. God yegl ta eran, nono God ye yoba i yoko kaima ere wakai ere tome dikramga. Ye mabuno wakai erumara i mina topo tome dinamga. Ba God mabunomo yegl ta paikrukwa. Ye yoba mabuno wakai ta erikwa pre ye ere wakai ere tekrukwa. Ye yoba yoko kaima ere wakai ere togwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ana Israel yoba mere kide ere mogl, no nono eun, yoba du moramnedi kogon podo erikwa ba God ye erimara i yoba du meglmedi kankrukwa. Israel yoba suom keme God konbauna si norumara i mina ta wigwa i, God ye kere i pere edidre, yoba du meglmedi kanugwa. Yegl erukwa ba Israel yoba tau mere pre mediglkrimara God ye kamo prikraiglmedi nomano si giglede togwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />God kamo okna beglkwa i ama mem swara i pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">God kamo prikraiglmedi ye nomano si giglede togwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">Ye gumuglno kin yenabedi ersre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">kinano gi dinabedi eruko, ye erme pra, ka prikrimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 29.4, Aisaia 29.10</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:8">di, God kamo yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Te, King Devit ama okna ibo mem swara i pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">Yoba i ame di mogl, kaya mokna podo nedre, wakai munedi primara i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">God ye ere si, ere kide ere tenan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ye mabunono kide i pre topo kide idre, yage sinaiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />God ye gumuglno si kin yenan, ye ta kankraiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">Te, God ye yubun mere tenan, ye aimadi magi keme di wan moraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 69.22-23</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:10">di, King Devit yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ana Israel yoba tau mere kide God konbaunamo mina ukrikwa i pre ye aimadi kamun meda meglbi, God ye kide kodinabo? Ta manugwa. Okuo Israel yoba nomane kor ibi, God ye ere wakai ere te pai morabuka ba erme ye God mokono teimara i mina Jisas kamo ede yugobuno pere pere meglmara i ogo, God ye yoba mere yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, ere yugwa. God prukwa i, ye yugobuno pere pere ere ibo, Israel yoba kandre, kide pre, nomane kor inaiglmedi prukwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ana Israel yoba tadaglme ere, ka prikrimara i mina yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, Jisas kamo prisre, taragl wakai kaima igwa. Ba prio! Israel yoba nomane idre, ede ikne God moglkwa wibi, taragl wakai kaima plau dinabuka. Israel yoba ya yugobuno pere pere akie wakai kaima moraiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Na Israel yoba pre ka di moglka i, ene yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, pre pogl sinaiglkwa pre diga. God na kogon narsre, na dedugwa i, na Jisas kamo i pi yugobuno pere pere di tenatnedi na dedugwa. Ye kogon yegl naruko, na yugobuno pere pere meglmara ere wan moglka i, Israel yoba gumuglno mina kanaiglmedi ka ege mere di wan moglka. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />I siragl pre na prika i, God ye yoba meda meglkwa i, tau mere kide ere yugwa ka i na nina agrama Israel yoba di te moglbo, ye kide pre, God no ama ere inabedi pribi, na ka dinaglmara i ye tau agre ede ikne wiga mere yegl panabuka pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ene prio! Israel yoba ye God mokono tedre, Jisas kamo prakiurimara i, Jisas kamo ede uglo koglo koglo ogo, yoba mere kide uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i Jisas kamo prisre, ede suna u, God bogl deno muduno swara yeigwa. Israel yoba mabuno kide yegl erimara i, taragl wakai ene yoba meda meglmara i plau dugwa ba ye aglke kor nomane idre, Jisas kamo pre mediglbi, God ye i suna edenan, taragl wakai kaima plau dinabuka. Israel yoba gogl kodidre, adigl u kor eigwa mere yegl panabuka. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ede ta God edemo mere yegl ta panan, ede yogagle i ama God pre panabuka. Israel yoba kowano awano Abraham i, ede i mere yegl moglko, Israel yoba erme meglkwa i ede i yogagle mere yegl meglkwa. God ye okna ibo Abraham, ede mere yegl moglkwa i, ka kaima mere di te padiglsre, ama ye suglmo moglka. Yegl pre Israel yoba erme meglkwa, ede yogagle mere yegl meglkwa i, God ye ka okna di te paduglmara i pre ye suglno mogl pai moran, ye okuo nomane kor idre, ede suna unaiglkwa kuno erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Na ede pre diga i, yegl pre diga. Abraham okna ibo moglkwa i, ye ede oliv mere yegl ta moglkwa. God ye okna dugwa i, Abraham gawama ere wakai ere tenagle dugwa pre ede yogagle ede mina nuglo wakai yumere yegl, Abraham gawama meglkwa i, ye ede yogagle mere yegl mogl, taragl wakai igwa ba God erme ede yogagle tau si buko di edidre, ene yugobuno pere pere, meda meglkwa i suna edugwa i, ede oliv are yogagle yu, ede mina si dagugwa mere yegl paugwa. Yegl pre erme Israel yoba ta munga i ya te, ene yugobuno pere, meda ta meglkwa i pra, God ye Abraham gawama ere wakai ere tenagle dumara i mina nono pra pra taragl wakai yumga. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Yegl paugwa ba ene prio! Ene ere mogl, No Israel yoba againo yumga pre ye egre tomniwe di, ene yegl ta praiglkwa i kuno erekrukwa. Ene ede mere yegl moglkrikwa ba ede yogagle pere ta u ede mina si dagigwa mere yegl meglkwa. Ede i ta yogagle mina nuglo inan, kuno erekrabuka ba ede yogagle i, ede mina nuglo inan, kuno erabuka.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ana yoba ta prabuka i, God ye no yugobuno pere, meda munga i, i suna edenagledi Israel yoba ede yogagle mere yegl si buko didre, kide kodumiwe di, yegl prabuka. <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />God ye kaima ede yogagle tau si buko didre, kide kodugwa ba mem swara ta paugwa pre erukwa. Israel yoba i ye Jisas pre mediglkrikwa pre yegl erukwa. Te, God yoba yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i tau i suna edugwa i, ye Jisas pre mediglmara swara i pre i suna edugwa. Yegl pre yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i, ye mogl mitna edumnedi prikre, God kuduglmo goraiglkwa kuno erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ene prio! Israel yoba ye Abraham gawama meglkwa ba ye pre mediglkrimara i, God ye kide kodugwa. Yegl pre yoba yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i ta pre mediglkribi, God yoba i ama kide kodinabuka keme paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />God siragl mere moglkwa i, ene prio! Ye yoba tau ere wakai ere tedre, yoba tau dem kubro tedre, erukwa. Israel yoba ye mokono God teigwa i, ye dem kubro togwa ba ene yugobuno pere meda meglkwa i ye ama ene ere wakai ere togwa. God ye yugobuno pere pere meda meglkwa i ere wakai ere togwa ba yoba meda i, God yoko kaima yoba ere wakai ere togwa ka i pre mediglkre, mokono tebi, God ye ama ere wakai ere tekrabuka. Ye ede yogagle si buko di edumere yegl, ye kide kodinabuka. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Te, Israel yoba we, ye tau mere pre mediglkrikwa ba ye ta nomane kor idre, pre mediglbi, God ye ede yogagle i suna ede, si dagumere yegl, ye i suna edenabuka. God yegl erabuka i, waragine paikrukwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />I siragl pre yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i, ye oliv are yogagle mere yegl meglkwa ba God ye i suna edidre, ede mina si dage paduglkwa. Ye yegl erukwa i waragine pamedi pramga ba ye ere kodugwa. Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga. Israel yoba ta nomane kor idre, pre mediglbi, ye yene edeno mina aglke kor i suna edidre, si daginabuka kuno erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel okuo ede ikne unaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Agrama wagle, Israel yoba erikwa i, yoba mere pre pogl sikrikwa ba God di norukwa pre ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi prika. Ene pre pogl sinaiglme diga i, yegl pre diga, Israel yoba tau mere nomano gigle dugo, Jisas kamo prikrikwa ba ye nomano aimadi yegl ta gigle di pai moglkrabuka. Yoba yugobuno pere, meda meglmara yoba ta Jisas pre mediglsre, ede suna unaiglkwa i, mudu u kodibi, okuo Israel yoba ta moraiglkwa i, nomane kor idre, Jisas kamo praiglkwa. Yegl pre ene yugobuno meda meglkwa i Israel yoba againo yumnedi prisre, mogl mitna edumnedi prikraiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Okuo Israel yoba Jisas kamo pre mediglbi, God ye mudu ere inabuka. Okna ibo mem swara i pre God yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">Yoba Ere Inabuka Yagl i, ye dumo Jerusalem mina plau didre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Israel yoba mabunono kide ere edenabuka.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ege i, na ka okna di te padiglmere ere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">Israel yoba tadaglmeno gugl edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 27.9, 59.20-21</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:27">di, God yegl dumiwe di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Ana Israel yoba meglkwa i, ye Jisas kamo prakiurimara i, ye God kudamo ikna mere yegl meglkwa. Ye yegl erikwa pre Jisas kamo ede u yugobuno pere pere meglmara i ugwa. Yegl pre ene yugobuno meda meglmara taragl wakai plau di togwa. Ba God okna kaima ibo Israel yoba kowano awano kere yugwa pre ye kere yumara i, dem muduo te pai moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />I siragl pre God yoba ta agle didre, yoko kaima ere wakai ere togwa i, aimadi ere wakai ere te morabuka. God nomane kor idre, ye ta kide kodokrabuka.<verse eid="ROM 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ene yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i, okna God kamo duglo boglkre, meda meglkwa ba Israel yoba ye God kamo prakiurikwa i pre God aglke kor ene meglmara kogon podo ersre, ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Te, ene okna erimere kuno yegl, erme Israel yoba ye God mokono tedre, meda meglko, God ene yugobuno meda meglkwa i yoko kaima ere wakai ere togwa. Ye ene ere wakai ere tomara i, Israel yoba kandre, nomane kor ibi, ye ama yoko kaima ere wakai ere tenagledi prukwa pre yegl erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />God ye yoba mudu, no Israel yoba munga i ya yugobuno pere, meda meglkwa i pra, nono ye kamo duglo boglkunga i pre kane panaiglmedi erukwa. Ye no kane panaiglmedi erukwa i, mem wakai ta paugwa pre erukwa. Nono mudu kane padre, yoba kide munedi prumun, ye nono mudu yoko kaima ere wakai ere inabuka i pre erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />God moglkwa i, ye nomanemo podo kide paugo, taragl mudu pre kan ere kodugwa. God ye kogon siragl mere eragledi prisre, erukwa i, nono yoba munga i ta pre pogl sinamga kuno erekrukwa. Ye yagl podo kaima moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />God kamo okna ibo beglkwa i mina yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Yagl Kade nomanemo siragl mere paugwa i, yoba swara ta pre pogl sikrikwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Yoba swara ta ere mogl, God ka beke tedre, nomane tekrumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 40.13</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:34">di, yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Te, God kamo bage ta mina ama yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">Yoba ye taraglmo ta God togo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">God moglmara dina ta pamo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">Ta manga! Yoba taragl swara ta God tekrimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jop 41.11</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:35">di, yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />God swara taragl mudu ere yedre, te taragl mudu ama erme sugl mogl pai moglkwa. Yegl pre ye taragl mudu ere yomara i mina kagie kade inabuka paugwa. Nono munga i ama aimadi kamun God kagie kade te pai moramga. Kaima.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Nono ogono nagno God tenamga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Agrama abarama wagle, God mitno podo goglsre, nono ere wakai ere noro kodugwa i pre na ene di tenagledi prika i, ene ogono nagino God tenaiglmedi prika. Yoba sipsip si gogl, mudu gagl tawa teimere mere yegl, ene kor meglmere i, ogono nagino mudu God tenaiglkwa i pre diga. Ene ka kaima God kagie kade tenamnedi pribi, ene yegl eraiglkwa. Yegl eribi, God ama wakai prabuka. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ene mogl pai eraiglmara i, yoba meda God bogl moglkrikwa i mogl pai erimere yegl erekrio! Ene God nomane norabedi agai tebi, God ene nomane kor kor inaiglmedi tenabuka. Tenan, God ene siragl mere eraiglmedi prukwa i, ene pre pogl sinaiglkwa. God mabuno tau wakai kanugwa i, mabuno wakai ya mabuno du i, ene kaima pre pogl sinaiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ana God yene na ere wakai ere narsre, na ye kamo i pi yoba di tenatnedi na dedugwa. God kogon yegl narukwa pre na erme ye dra idre, ene swara swarade yegl di tenaglka, ene mogl mitna edekrio! Ene ka mem pamere pribi, ene yegl praiglkwa, No pre medungo, God yene prumere ere mogl, no ye kogonmo eraiglmedi noro pere pere edugwa ba no yoba kuno keme munedi yegl praiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4-5" />Nono Jisas yugobunomo mina munga i, yoba swara mogl, kuno keme munga. Nono ogono nagino kunga i, ene kanio! Yoba ogo nagie swara paugwa ba ogo nagie swara i mina gumuglo paugo, guma dra paugo, ogo kagle pere pere paigwa i, ye ama kogono pere pere paugwa. Kuno yegl mere nono mudu Krais yugobunomo mina munga i, kogono pere pere paugwa ba nono ye ogo nagie swara mere yegl munga pre nono swara kaima munga.<verse eid="ROM 12:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />God ye nono mudu ere wakai ere norsre, ye nono kogonmo eraiglmedi noro pere pere edugwa. God kogon siragl mere norukwa i, nono mudu eramga paugwa. God ene ye kamo kep eratnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, God kamo kaima pamere kep ere dinatnga. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Te, God ene yoba ake ple di tenatnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, ene yoba ake ple di tenatnga. Te, ye ama ene God kamo yoba beke tenatnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, ene ye kamo yoba beke tenatnga. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Te, God ene yoba deno muduno mina si gigledi tenatnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, ene kogon yegl eratnga. Mo, ene mige moni mina ye kogonmo ake ple dinatnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, ene gun yedre, mige moni tenatnga kuno erabere to. Mo, God ene yoba suglno moratnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, ene kogon i dimede eratnga. Te, God ene yoba ta yubun inaiglkwa i mitno goglsre, ake ple di tenatnedi kogon yegl ta tenan, ene gun yedre, kogon yegl i, eratnga. God nono mudu kogon noro pere pere edugwa i, yegl mere eramga paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ene yoba gumuglno mina ye deno muduno teigwa dagl ere, ye mokono mina deno muduno ta tekribi, kuno erekrukwa. Ene yoba ka kaima deno muduno teo. Te, mabuno kide ta panabuka i, ene kide kan, erekre, mabuno wakai ta panabuka i ake gi di mogl, erio. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Pre mediglkwa yoba ta moraiglkwa i, ye no agroma abaroma meglmedi kandre, deno muduno ikne ikne teo. Ene enene mogl atne edidre, agroma abaroma ta moraiglkwa i pre i mitna ede teo. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Te, ene Yagl Kade kogonmo erikwa i, ene nomano mina ka kaima eramnedi prisre, oglka erekre, kogon podo ere pai molo.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ene okuo God bogl akie wakai kaima moraiglkwa i, ege ege poglo di prisre, gun yei, ama kamage ege ege erio. Te, yubun ta ene meglmara unan, adigl giglede molo. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Te, God yobama ta kaya mokna mo ki ta yeikrabuka i, ake ple di tedre, agroma abaroma yogugl ta unaiglkwa i, ere wakai ere teo.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Yoba ta ene ere kide ere tebi, God yoba i ere kide ere tenabedi agle di prikrio. God ye ake ple di tenabedi agle di teo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Yoba ta gun yenaiglkwa igne i ene ama ye bogl akie gun yeo. Te, ye yubun idre, kai eraiglkwa igne, ene ama ye bogl akie kai erio. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ene ikne ikne deno muduno swara yei moraiglkwa. Te, ene mogl mitna edidre, yoba kade munedi prikre, yoba ta kagno paikrukwa i bogl akie wan, ye meglmere yegl, kuno moraiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ana yoba ta ene ere kide ere tebi, ene ere ikne ede tekrio. Te, ene mabuno ta duglo beglbi, yoba wakai kanaiglkwa i keme duglo bolo. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ene ege ege yoba pere bogl deno muduno swara yedre, wakai moraiglkwa mabuno i erio. Ene yegl eribi, ene erikwa i yene ta kide pribi, yene mina panabuka ba ene siragl mere eraiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Na agrama abarama dena muduna suna meglkwa i, na ka mitna di kodiga, yoba ta ene ere kide ere tebi, ene ere ikne ede tekrio diga. I siragl pre ene God agai tebi, ye yene yoba mabuno kide eraiglkwa i dem kubro tedre, ere te ikne edenabuka. God kamo mina okna ibo yegl beglkwa, Yoba mabuno kide beglbi, nana ere ikne ede tenaglka. I na nana kogona pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 32.35</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Te, God kamo bage ta ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Ene kudanen ikne kidan goran, ene kaya mokna gagl to.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">Mo, ye nigl goran, ene nigl kogl to.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Ene yegl etn, ye ene ere kide ere tomara i, agai podo gorabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ame Wakai Dinaiglkwa 25.21-22</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:20">di, God kamo yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Te, mabuno kide ene yobuglo ere norabedi kanige erekrio. Ene mabuno wakai ersre, mabuno kide egre atne edio.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Gavman yoba moraiglmara mogl atne edinamga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Ana yoba kade gavman meglkwa i, God prumere u nono bitno meglko, God yene no bitno moraiglmedi i edugwa pre ye meglmara mogl atne edidre, kano pramga paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Yoba ta ye kano sedibi, ye ama God kamo sedigwa. Yoba mabuno yegl ta eribi, ye ka inaiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Yoba ta mabuno wakai erikwa i, ye gavman yoba ta kuduglno gogl tekraiglkwa. Yoba ta ye no sinaiglmedi kudugl geglkwa i, ye mabuno kide erikwa pre gavman yoba kuduglno gogl teigwa. Yegl pre ene ta kuduglno goglkramnedi pribi, mabuno wakai erio. Yegl eribi, gavman yoba ta ene ere sikraiglkwa. Ye kandre, ene wakai erimiwe dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />God ye ene wakai moraiglmedi gavman yoba kade ta meglkwa i, kogon dedugo, erikwa. Ba ene kano sedidre, mabuno kide ye mane dimara i eribi, ene kuduglno goraiglkwa i, kuno erukwa. I siragl pre God ye gavman yoba kogon ta ama togwa i, yoba mabuno kide ta eribi, ye ere te ikne edidre, ere sinaiglmedi kogon togwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Yegl pre ene gavman yoba nono bitno meglkwa i kano praiglkwa paugwa i, mem suo paugwa. Ta we, ene ye kano sedibi, ka inaiglkwa. Te, ta we, ene ye kano duglo boraiglkwa i, mabuno du paugwa pre ene ye kano duglo boglsre, mabuno du eunedi prisre, wakai praiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ana gavman yoba nono bitno meglkwa i, kano duglo boramga paugwa pre mige moni taks ta norio dinaiglkwa i, ama nono tenamga paugwa. God ye gavman yoba nono ake ple di noraiglmedi kogon dedugo, ye ege ege kogon i erikwa pre mige taks tenamga i, kuno erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Yegl pre taks kane kane siragl mere ta norio dinaiglkwa i, ene teo. Tedre, gavman yoba i ama nono bitno meglmedi kuduglno goglsre, pre i mitna edio.<figure style="fig" alt="Roman coins" file="hk00166b.tif" size="col" loc="13.7" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="13.7" /><verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ene dina ta eribi, panabuka i, tabre te ikne edio. Mige moni ya ki ta dina erumun, panabuka i, te ikne edimun, dudunabuka. Yegl paugwa ba kogon swara ta ege ege eramga paugwa i, dina mere yegl ta paugwa. Kogon i, deno muduno yoba tenamga paugwa. Yegl eramga i, dina mere yegl aimadi aimadi pai morabuka. I ta dudumedi prikramga.Te, ene prio! Ene yoba pere deno muduno tebi, ene God lomo mudu pamere erikwa mere yegl panabuka. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9-10" />God lomo mina lo swara ta yegl dugwa, Ene enene wakai kanimere yegl, ene yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i ama wakai kanio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba 19.18, Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.13-17</char></note> dugwa. Yoba ta lo swara i duglo boglsre, dem muduo yoba tenan, ye lomo tau mudu ama duglo boglkwa mere panabuka. Prio! God lomo tau dugwa i, Ene yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekrio! didre, Yoba si goglkrio! didre, Yoba pere taraglno kunogl nekre, bubuno goglkrio! dugwa. Lo yegl paugwa i ya te, lo kane kane siragl mere paugwa i, yoba ta ye yoba pere wakai kanan, ye mabuno kide kane kane i ta ere, yoba ta tekrabuka paugwa. Mabuno kide kane kane yegl ta ere, yoba ta tenan, ye yoba i wakai kankrukwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 13:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ene ebrie mabunono pre na ka mere ene di teiga i, nono ege erme siragl mere munga i, ene pre pogl sidre, duglo boraiglkwa paugwa. Ene erme ugl panaiglkwa ege yeikrukwa pre ene adilo! Nono Jisas koragle pre medunga igne, God nono agre ede heven ibo enabuka igne i tau eglke yei pai moglkwa ba erme ede magigl u kodugwa pre diga. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Yoba eduer mabuno kide kane kane erikwa ba nono munara i, eduer dudugwa. Kamin tagenagledi erukwa pre nono kugugl gagl deglbi yogwa gugl edumnere yegl, mabuno kide i kide kodidre, soldia kuda kugugl gagl edimere mere yegl, nono abuglage sumara mogl pai ersre, mabuno wakai boramga. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ermine, abuglage sumara moramga kuno erabere mere mabuno boramga pre diga i, yegl mere paugwa, nono mabuno gua gua ersre, spak ere, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nedre, agl erimere mere yegl ersre, yegl ta erekramga. Te, nono ama yoba deno kubro tedre, kigl nonga dikramga paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ka kaima ene deno muduno goglo pamara, mabuno kide kane kane pogglau borabuka i, agai tekre, Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ene suglno morabedi mogl atne ede molo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Taragl kebra pre kigl nonga dikramga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Ana yoba ta Jisas pre medrabuka ba ye ere mogl, Na siragl mere mogl pai eribo wakai panabumada di, kina suo yenabuka i ta moran, ene no agro ta moglmedi kan, ye di i suna edio. Ye di i suna edidre, kina suo yenabara i pre kigl nonga dikrio. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Yoba ta nomane swara keme yenabuka i, ye mie nenamga i, aglau ta paikrumiwe di, pre pogl sinabuka ba yoba ta kina suo yenabuka i, ye pre pogl sikre, mie nenamga i, aglau pamiwedi prabuka. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yoba ta mie nogwa i, ye ere mogl, yoba ta nekrukwa i du erumiwe di, yegl ta prikrabuka. Te, kaya mokna keme nogwa yoba i ere mogl, mie nogwa yoba i God gumuglo mina aglau erumiwedi prikrabuka. God yoba i wakai kan kodugwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Yoba ta ere mogl, yoba pere ta niglmo kogonmo yoba Kide etniwe dinabuka i, ye kogonmo ta paikrukwa. Yoba ta ye niglmo kogonmo ere togwa yoba i, yene Wakai etniwe dinabuka mo Kide etniwe dinabuka i, kuno erukwa. Kuno yegl mere, ene meglmara suna i, taragl tau yoba kinano suo yenabara i mina ene ikne ikne Kide etniwe dinaiglkwa i ta kuno erekrukwa. Yagl Kade swara ene mudu bitno moglkwa pre yene ene mogl pai eraiglmara ake kun ere tedre, Wakai erimiwe dinabuka keme paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Na kaya mokna ya mie pre di kodiga ba na ka ta ama yegl dinaglka, yoba tau praiglkwa i, Wakan swara swarade, ege swara ta God egemo yomedi pre, ege i ye kagie kade tenamga pamiwe di, yegl praiglkwa. Te, yoba tau praiglkwa i, God kagie kade tenamga i, ege swara keme yeikrukwa, ege ege kuno keme yomedi, yegl praiglkwa. Pra, ye suo akie kinano suo yeikre, ye yene wakai ta praiglmere i, eraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Yoba ta ege swara ta God egemo yomedi prukwa i, ye ege i, i pere ede, Yaglno Kade kagie kade tenagledi prukwa pre wakai erukwa. Te, yoba ta mie nogwa i, ye God di wakai yei tedre, nogwa pre ye Yaglno Kade kagie kade togwa. Te, yoba ta mie nekrukwa i, ye God na eratnedi prumere i eriedi prisre, ama God di wakai yei tedre, kaya mokna nogwa pre ye ama Yaglno Kade kagie kade togwa. Ye mabuno siragl mere ta erikwa i, u swara ogwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7-8" />Nono munga i, Yagl Yade yobama munga. Yegl pre nono kor mogl, wan moramga igne i no nono wakai moramnedi ere wan moglkramga. Yagl Kade kagie kade inabedi ere wan moramga paugwa. Te, Yagl Kade kagie kade inabedi goramga panan, ye pre ama goramga. <verse eid="ROM 14:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Krais goglsre, adigl u kor ogwa i, ye nono mudu Yaglno Kade morabuka pre erukwa. Nono erme kor munga i mo agroma abaroma tau geglkwa i, Jisas swara nono mudu i swara ede, Yaglno Kade moglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Nono swara swarade okuo God gumuglo mina adigl mun, ye swara nono mogl pai eunere i pre yubu sidre, Wakai etniwe didre, Kide etniwe didre, erabuka. Yegl pre siragl eruko, ene tau jas mere yegl munedi pre, agroma abaroma mogl pai erimara pre yubu sime? Te, siragl eruko, ene tau kan atne edidre, agroma abaroma du erimedi kanime? <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />God kamo mina bage ta yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Na Yagl Kade moglka i, ene ka kaima di teiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Yoba mudu na gumuglnamugl goglkono bodiglsre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">na swara God motniwe di, yegl dinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 45.23</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 14:11">dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Yegl pre nono pre pogl sinamga. Nono swara swarade siragl mere mogl pai eunere i, God gumuglo mina adigl mogl, di poramga.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ana nono swara swarade mogl pai eunere i, God moglmara di poramga pre ene ogono buglo si iro edidre, agroma abaroma ta yoba kide meglme digwa i, kide kodio. Mabuno i kide kodidre, enene mabunono siragl mere beglkwa i kan kun ersre, wan moraiglkwa. I siragl pre ene mabuno ta beglbi, agroma abaroma kandre, kide praiglkwa i mo ene eraiglmere yegl ta sika sidre, mabuno kide ta eribi, kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Na ka swara ta yegl dinaglka, na pre kan erika i, mie kane kane mo kaya mokna kane kane ta i nenamga i, aglau ta paikrukwa. Ka i, na drana mina dikrika ba nono Yaglno Kade Jisas i, yene dugwa pre na ka yegl diga. Yegl paugwa ba yoba ta ere mogl, taragl swara ta i nenabuka i aglau pamedi prisre, i nenan, ye pre ka kaima aglau paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Yegl pre ene taragl swara ta i nen, agitn ta kandre, i kide yomedi kide pran, yegl mere i wakai ta paikrabuka. Ene agitn i den mudun tekitnga mere yegl panabuka. Krais ene agitn i pre goglkwa pre ene taragl ta i nenatnara i mina agitn ere kide ere tekro. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ene mie mo taragl ta i nenatnga i, ene aglau ta paikrumedi pre pogl sinatnga ba agitn ta kina suo yogo, ye pre pogl sikrukwa i kandre, ene tadaglme etnedi pran, ene ye kide pre dinabedi nekratnga ama wakai paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />God nono kingno mogl, suglno moglkwa i, ye nono kaya mokna siragl mere nomga mo nekunga i, ya nigl siragl mere nomga mo nekunga i ta pre yubun dekrukwa. Ye ta prukwa i, Mudu Murubuglo nono deno muduno mina kogon eran, nono mabuno du ersre, agroma abaroma bogl deno muduno swara yei, gun yei moraiglmedi prukwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Yoba ta mabuno yegl ersre, Krais kogonmo eran, God kandre, wakai prabuka. Te, yoba ama kandre, wakai praiglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ana God nono mabuno yegl eraiglmedi prukwa pre nono ege ege deno muduno swara yenamnedi ersre, agroma abaroma yakenaiglmedi ake ple di tenamga. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ene mie mo kaya mokna ta i nenaiglmara i mina, God kogonmo ere kide erekrio. Mie kane kane mo kaya mokna kane kane nenaiglkwa i, aglau ta paikrukwa ba ene taragl ta i nebi, agro kandre, kide yomedi kide prabo mo yage sinabuka i, ene aglau erikwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ene agro kide prisre, yage si dinabedi mie mo wain nuglo mo taragl swara ta ene i nekribi, i wakai panabuka.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ene taragl kane kane ta i nenatnga i, ene pre pogl sidre, aglau ta paikrumedi pitn, i nenatnga. Ba ene agitn ta ene pitnere i sika sinabedi ake nu sikro. Ene swara i, God bogl miurara paugwa. Ene ere mogl, Na taragl kane kane i nenaglka i aglau ta paikrumiwe di, yegl prisre, kinan suo yekran, ene gun yedre, i nenatnga. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ba yoba ta kina suo yenan, ye mie mo ki ta i nenan, ye aglau erukwa. Ye i kide yomedi prisre, nogwa pre tadaglme erukwa. Te, mabuno kane kane eramga i, ama yegl paugwa. Nono ere mogl, mabuno ta eramga i wakai pamo mo kide pamo mo i pre pogl sikre, eun, tadaglme erumga.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Nono yoba tau kinano suo yeikruko, mie nomga i, nono keme nenamnedi erekramga. Nono pre medunga gigle dugwa i, gigle dikrukwa i, kide kankre, ake ple di tenamga paugwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Agroma abaroma kide kankre, gun yenaiglmedi erumun, ye wakai mogl yakenaiglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Krais moglkwa i, ye ama yegl erukwa. Ye yene wakai prabuka i pre ere wan moglkrukwa. Ye nono ake ple di noragledi yubun yugwa. God kamo mina yoba ta Jisas dra idre, yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:3">God yo, yoba ene di kide yei tedre, ene ere kide ere tenamnedi erimara i mina na ama yubun iwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 69.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:3">di, yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ana ene prio. God kamo siragl mere okna ibo beglkwa i, nono erme munga i ama beke inaiglmedi beglkwa. God kamo nono si gigledi noran, nono adigl gigledi mogl, God bogl okuo wakai kaima moramnedi sugl moramga i pre ye beglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Ana God yoba deno muduno si gigle didre, adigl gigledi moraiglmedi erukwa God i, Krais Jisas yoba kanumere mere ene ikne ikne kanaiglmedi eran, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ene kaima deno muduno swara yedre, ene u swara pi mogl, God kagie kade tenaiglkwa. God we diga i, ye nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais Nem moglsre, Godmo moglkwa i pre diga.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ana yegl pre Krais nono ere di i suna edumere mere yegl, ene agroma abaroma mudu ama di i suna edio. Ene yegl eribi, God kagie kade inabuka. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Krais siragl mere erukwa i, ene prio! Ye ede makandigle ugwa i, ye yene wakai moragledi ukrukwa. God ye ege ege ka dumara adigl moglkwa pre ye okna ibo Juda yoba kowano awano ka kaima di te paduglkwa i kaima plau dinan, Juda yoba wakai moraiglkwa pre Jisas udre, niglno kogono yoba mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Ba Jisas ugwa i, ye Juda yoba swara i keme wakai moraiglmedi ukrukwa. Ye u kogon erukwa i, Jentail yoba ama mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tenan, yoba i ama kandre, God kagie kade tenaiglmedi u kogon erukwa. God kamo okna ibo beglkwa i, bage swara ta mem i pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">God yo, na yugobuno pere pere, meda meglmara i, ene kagn kade tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Giglagenen dinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Samuel 22.50, Giglage 18.49</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:9">di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Ana God kamo yegl didre, bage ta ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">Ene Jentail yoba God yobama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Juda yoba i bogl akie gun yeio!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 32.43</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:10">di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />God kamo yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Ene Jentail yoba Yaglno Kade kagie kade teo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 117.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:11">di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ana, God kamo kep yagl Aisaia ama ka swara ta yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">King Devit nem, kagie Jesi we digwa i, ye gawamo ta okuo udre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, mudu i swara ede kingno mogl, suglno morabuka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Ye unan, Jentail yoba ye swara no ere wakai ere norabedi pre gi dinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 11.10</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:12">di, yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Ana ene God kamo pre mediglkwa pre ye ene meglmara nomane wakai tedre, ene gun yenaiglmedi ere, deno muduno wida di, ene meglmara padigl tenabedi prika. Yegl eran, te, Mudu Murubuglo ene yobuglo bogl tenan, ene okuo God bogl wakai kaima moraiglkwa i, ege ege pre gi di moraiglkwa. I siragl pre God nomane wakai ege ege ye yobama togo, ye okuo wakai kaima moramgra we di, pre gi digwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Agrama abarama wagle, na prika, ene mabuno wakai bogl moglsre, God kamo okna prikwa i, ene pre pogl sigwa pre na pepa ta ene bogl tekria, ene ere mogl, God kamo okna primere i, enene ikne ikne beke inaiglkwa i, kuno eruko. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Kuno erukwa ba na ka tau giglede boglka i, ene kor poglo di praiglkwa pre boglka. I siragl pre God yoko kaima ye na ere wakai ere narsre, kogon ta narukwa i, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />na Krais Jisas niglmo kogonmo yoba moglsre, ye kamo i pi ene yugobuno pere pere meglmara di tenatnedi kogon yegl narukwa. Na kogon narukwa i ersre, God kamo wakai yoba di te moglka i, yoba sipsip gagl, God tawa teimere yegl, na kogon erika i, kuno yegl mere erika. Yoba tawa gagl God teigo, God yumere mere yegl, na Jisas kamo yugobuno pere pere di teigo, yoba ta pre mediglkwa i, Mudu Murubuglo ye ere i God yobama edugo, God ye kan yugwa. Yegl pre na yoba i, i pi God teigo, ye yoba i kan yugwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />God kogon yegl narukwa pre na gun yedre, kogon i ere moglka. Jisas Krais na yobuglo bogl naruko, God kogonmo erika i, u wakai ogwa pre na wakai pre, ene di teiga. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Na nana kogon wakai erika pre dikrika. Kaima na nana yobra mina yegl erie dikraglka. Krais swara yobuglo bogl naruko, na kogon ersre, God kamo yoba di teiga. Kogon yegl eriko, yoba yugobuno pere pere, meda meglkwa i tau mere God kamo prisre, duglo beglkwa i pre na gun yedre, ene di teiga. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />God Murubuglo yobuglo bogl naruko, na kimagl kane kane ersre, Krais kamo wakai i, yoba di teiga. Na dumo Jerusalem Jisas kamo yoba di tedre, ede pi bage bage di tedre, ede eglke kaima pi provins ta Ilirikum we dimara i ama Jisas kamo yoba di tei kodiga.<verse eid="ROM 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Na okna kogon mabuno bogl erika igne ede u erme ugwa i, na ege ege yegl kinana gudu prika, yoba tau ede okna pi Krais kamo yoba di teimara i, aglke kor dagl ta pi di tekragledi prika. Na prika i, Jisas kamo wakai i, i pi yoba ta okna prikrimara i keme di tenagledi prika. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />God kamo bage ta mem i pre yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">Yoba ye ka okna ta di teigo, prikrikwa i, ye ama prisre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">pre pogl sinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 52.15</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:21">di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Na ege mere ene meglmara unagledi prika ba kogon mere paugo, ukrika i, mem swara i paugwa. Na Jisas kamo i pi yoba ta prikrimara di tenagledi prika swara i pre kogon podo paugo, na u ene kankrika.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol Rom yoba meglmara unagledi prie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Na bugla yugu tau mere ene meglmara u kanagledi prika ba kogon mere paugwa pre okna na ene meglmara u ene kanaglka i, kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa ba erme na dumo tau kogon ere wan moglmara i, ere kodiga pre erme ka kaima ene meglmara unaglka kuno erabedi prika. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Erme na kantri Spen we dimara i, pi kogon eragledi prika pre na Spen enagledi unaglka igne i komono kana ene meglmara u kandre, okuo ede Spen enagledi prika. Na wibo, ene bogl ege tau akie mun, na wakai kaima prisre, okuo ede Spen enaglka. Te, na ama prika i, ene bogl akie mun, ene na ake ple di narsre, dedibi, na ede kantri Spen enagledi prika.<verse eid="ROM 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25-26" />Ana na yegl mere ere, wan u ene meglmara unagledi prika ba komono kana na ede Jerusalem enaglka paugwa. I siragl pre nono agroma abaroma provins Masedonia ya Akaia suna meglkwa i, ye yene wakai primere mige moni tau makai sidre, pre mediglkwa yoba God yobama dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i, ake ple di tenamnedi makai sigwa. Agroma abaroma dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i, yubun idre, tau mige moni ya ki ta kan nekrikwa pre ye mige tau makai sidre, na i pi tenatnedi narikwa. Yegl pre na i pi tedre, okuo ene meglmara unaglka paugwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Agroma abaroma provins Masedonia ya Akaia i, ye yene wakai primere mige makai sigwa i, ye ake ple di tenaiglkwa paugwa pre kuno erukwa. I siragl pre Juda yoba Jisas kamo pre mediglkwa, dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i, ye Jisas kamo i pi yoba bina di teimara i, Jisas kamo wai dugo, Masedonia ya Akaia yoba ama akie Jisas kamo prisre, ye Juda yoba bogl akie kiano mina wakai meglkwa. Juda yoba kogon yegl eriko, ye kiano mina wakai meglkwa pre ye gun yeimara i, kan ikne ede, Juda yoba ogono nagino mina ake ple di tenaiglkwa i kuno erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ana kogon yegl paugwa pre yoba mige makai si narikwa i, na i pi Jerusalem pre mediglkwa yoba tedre, okuo na u ene kandre, ede kantri Spen enaglka. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Na prika, na u ene kanaglmara i, Krais ene meglmara kogon podo erse, ene ere wakai ere tenabedi prika.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Agrama abarama wagle, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais moglmara atne kra mungo, God Murubuglo nono deno muduno ikne ikne tenaiglmedi erukwa pre na ene di tenaglka i, ene na kogon erimara ake ple di naramnedi pribi, ene na pre God agle di prisre, kamage ere nario. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ene kamage eraiglkwa i, yoba distrik Judia mogl, Jisas kamo pre mediglkrikwa i na sinamnedi eribi, God na kugl bogl narabedi kamage ersre, te na mige moni i pi pre mediglkwa yoba, God yobama dumo Jerusalem meglkwa tenaglka i, ye gun yedre, inaiglmedi kamage erio. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />God yegl mere ake ple di narsre, na ene meglmara unatnedi pran, pra na gun yedre, ene meglmara unaglka. Wibo, ene bogl akie mun, na kuri ta mogl, ir si prisre, aglke ede kantri Spen enaglka.<verse eid="ROM 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Ana deno muduno wida di padigl norukwa God i, ene meglmara mogl tenabedi prika. Kaima.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Pol ka las dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ana abaro Fibi ye kuri ta mogl, no kide kodo, ene meglmara unabuka. Ye unan, ene ye kogl kare di, di inaiglmedi prika. Fibi i, ye Jisas yugobunomo dumo Senkria meglkwa i, ake ple di togwa abu moglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ye kogon yegl ersre, yoba tau mere ama ake ple di togwa. Te, ye ama na ake ple di narukwa pre na ene di prika i, ye ene meglmara unan, ene ye bogl akie Yagl Kade gagiglma munedi prisre, Fibi kogon siragl mere ta erabuka i, ene ye ake ple di tenaiglmedi prika. Nono God yobama munga i, nono mabuno yegl ere, ikne ikne ake ple di tenamga i, kuno erukwa.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ana abu Prisila ye wie Akwila bogl dumo Rom miurka i, ye di teo. Na ye di wakai yei teiga. Prisila ya Akwila i, no akie Krais Jisas kogonmo erumga. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Te, yagl abu suo i, ye okna na ake ple di naribrika pre yoba ye si goramnedi erikwa ba ye na kide kodokribrika pre na ye gun yei te, wakai we di teiga. Na swara keme yagl abu suo i wakai we di tekrika ba yoba yugobuno pere pere dumo bage bage ta meglmara, pre mediglkwa yoba ta makai sigwa i ama ye eribrika i kano digo prisre, wakai we di teigwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Yegl pre na yagl abu suo i di wakai yei tedre, te yoba Jisas yugobunomo mina ye kipabrara akie ta makai si moraiglkwa i ama di wakai yei teiga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Ana na kabaglena Epainetus, ye provins Esia suna komono kana Krais pre meduglkwa i, di wakai yei teiga. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Te, na abu Maria ama di wakai yei teiga. Ye ene ake ple di tedre, kogon podo ene meglmara ere togwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Te, Andronikus ya Junias no bormai swara munga i, ye ama di wakai yei teiga. Yagl suo i ye komono kana Krais yugobunomo mina ede suna ubriko, na mokonomugl ede suna wiga. Ye Jisas dedugwa yoba munara suna i, kogon podo eribrika. Te, okna no akie no si kane sigo, kane yugu akie pamga.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Ama nono Yaglno Kade yugobunomo mina suna munara, yagl Ampliatus, ye na bogl boma daguma kaima muglka i, di wakai yei teiga. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Te, na Urbanus, ye no yoba tau bogl akie Krais kogonmo erumga i, di wakai yei tedre, Stakis no boma daguma muglka i ama di wakai yei teiga.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ana na ama Apeles di wakai yei teiga. Ye Krais kogonmo erumara pre yubun yugwa ba yage sikre, adigl giglede moglkwa. Te, Aristobulus nem agiglema meglkwa i, ama di wakai yei teiga. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Na yoba i di wakai yei tedre, Herodion, no bormai swara muglka i ama di wakai yei tedre, Narsisus nem agiglema ta Yagl Kade yugobunomo mina meglkwa i ama di wakai yei teiga.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ana, na abu suo Trifina ya Trifosa ama di wakai yei teiga. Ye nono Yaglno Kade kogonmo podo eribrika. Te, abu Persis ama di wakai yei teiga. Ye na abara mere yegl moglsre, Yaglno Kade kogonmo ama podo erukwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Te, yagl Rufus ama di wakai yei teiga. Ye Yaglno Kade kamo ake gi didre, yoba tau mere duglo boglkrimere ye duglo boglkwa. Ye di wakai yei tedre, mam ama di wakai yei teiga. Ye mam i, na mana mere yegl moglkwa.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ana, na nokanma wagle Asinkritus ya Flegon ya Hermes ya Patrobas ya Hermas di wakai yei tedre, agroma abaroma tau ye bogl akie makai si meglkwa i ama di wakai yei teiga. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Te, nokanma tau, Filologus ya Julia, ya Nereus abauglo bogl, ya te Olimpas ya te, God yobama bogl ye yene akie makai si meglkwa i, ama mudu di wakai yei teiga.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ene agro abaro, pre mediglkwa yoba ta moraiglkwa i, ene akie God yobama munedi prisre, ye kogl kare di idre, di wakai yei teo. Te, yoba Krais yugobunomo mina dumo pere pere meglkwa i, na ye drano idre, na ene di wakai yei teiga.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Agrama abarama wagle, na ka ta ama ene di tenagledi prika i, yegl paugwa. Yoba tau ene meglmara si pere pere edinamnedi ersre, yoba ene God kamo beke teigo, primere i dikre, ka pere ta didre, ene yage sinaiglmedi eraiglkwa i, ene kan kun ersre, ye bogl akie moglkrio. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Yoba yegl mere ta erikwa i, ye nono Yaglno Kade Krais niglmo kogonmo yoba ta moglkrikwa. Ye yene kagno kade idre, taragl mere i nenamnedi ere wan meglkwa. Ye yoba tau nomano gigle dikrukwa i gun yenaiglmedi ka dogon erukwa didre, ama ka kibi kane kane didre, ye kinano sigo, ye kaima dimedi prikwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Yoba ere mogl, Rom pre mediglkwa yoba ye God kamo duglo bogl meglmiwe di, di wai digo, ene kano i ede uglo kogl koglo ogwa pre na prisre, ene gun podo yei teiga. Na prika ene ta yage sikraiglkwa ba ene kan kun eraiglkwa pre na ene ka di teiga. Na prika i, mabuno kide ene nomano mina paikran, mabuno wakai keme ene nomano mina kau sinabedi prika.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ana nono deno muduno wida di padigl norukwa God i, ye Satan kuda bogl tedre, yobuglomo egre atne edenabuka ege i, ede magigl u kodugwa. God yegl ere, Satan yobuglomo si dudinan, Satan ene okuo kuda bogl tekrabuka. Te, na prika, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ene aimadi yoko kaima ere wakai ere te morabedi prika.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Ana Timoti, ye na bogl akie kogon ere muglka i, ene di wakai yei togwa. Te, Lusius ya Jeson ya Sosipater, no bormai swara munga i, ye ene ama di wakai yei teigwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Te, Tertius, ka ene erme prikwa i na mudu di teigo, ye bogl atne ede narukwa i, ene Yaglno Kade yugobunomo mina akie munga i pre ye ene di wakai yei togwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23-24" />Te, Gaius, ye kipamara no akie pai muglka i, ene ama di wakai yei togwa. Gaius kipamara i no akie pai muglko, Jisas yugobunomo dumo i akie munga i, ye kipamara ama akie makai sumga. Te, Erastus, ye dumo i gavman migeno sugl moglkwa yagl i, ama ene di wakai yei togwa. Te, nono agro Kwartus ama ene di wakai yei togwa.<verse eid="ROM 16:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25-26" />Ana na Jisas Krais kamo wakai i, yoba di te wan moglsre, ka i ene ama beke teiga. Yegl pre ka i mina God ene si gigledi tenabuka. Jisas kamo wakai i, God okna ibo teke paduglkwa. Okna ibo teke paduglkwa ba God kamo kep yoba okna ibo ka bogl atne edimara i mina ye Jisas kamo i okuo u nogugl enabedi bogl atne edigwa. Bogl atne edimere yegl, kaima erme u nogugl ogwa. U nogugl ogo, God, ye aimadi kamin kor moglkwa i no di noro, Na kana i, ene i pi yugobuno pere pere uglo kogl koglo meglkwa i di teo! dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre no erme di wan mungo, yoba mere yugobuno pere pere, uglo kogl koglo meglkwa i ka i pre mediglsre, duglo beglkwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />God moglkwa i, ye swara nomanemo podo pai, pai kawa togo, ye Jisas Krais kogon erumara i mina nono ere yugwa pre nono ye kagie kade aimadi kamin te pai moramga. Kaima.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>